(2080138, 285738, 41802, '<td valign="top">Good work, I love the look and the heart ring gives the darkside of the image, something great.</td>', 'Good work, I love the look and the heart ring gives the darkside of the image, something great.', '2006-01-25 00:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080144, 285317, 35804, '<td valign="top">Yes! I love it! This definetly has the collodion aura about it...the light and tones are just lovely.</td>', 'Yes! I love it! This definetly has the collodion aura about it...the light and tones are just lovely.', '2006-01-25 00:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080145, 285747, 42826, '<td valign="top">great shot love the expression! 9</td>', 'great shot love the expression! 9', '2006-01-25 00:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080146, 283852, 17507, '<td valign="top">My brief inquiry into the work of Sally Mann was rewarding; you picked an excellent photographer (in my estimation) to emulate. However, this photo seems stylistically quite different from Mann. She often shoots children, yes, but generally partial (or full) nudity is involved, with a hint of eroticism that is lacking in this photo. Of the dozen or so of her photos I saw, none of them were cropped so tightly on a face, nor were there any blurry foreground elements.</td>', 'My brief inquiry into the work of Sally Mann was rewarding; you picked an excellent photographer (in my estimation) to emulate. However, this photo seems stylistically quite different from Mann. She often shoots children, yes, but generally partial (or full) nudity is involved, with a hint of eroticism that is lacking in this photo. Of the dozen or so of her photos I saw, none of them were cropped so tightly on a face, nor were there any blurry foreground elements.', '2006-01-25 00:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
