(2080215, 285241, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is fine for your grayscale freek, but composition wise ansel was a purest and tried to keep the frame as simple and beautiful as possible, i think that in his style that is just as important as the grayscale (b/c now ppl. can fake the grayscale so efficently)....i''m sorry to say but i feel u missed the mark with way 2 busy a composition.</td>', 'this is fine for your grayscale freek, but composition wise ansel was a purest and tried to keep the frame as simple and beautiful as possible, i think that in his style that is just as important as the grayscale (b/c now ppl. can fake the grayscale so efficently)....i''m sorry to say but i feel u missed the mark with way 2 busy a composition.', '2006-01-25 00:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
