(2080250, 283468, 23913, '<td valign="top">lol, not bad not bad at all. as far as the photo goes pretty much did it. i think there is something missing that Avedon always had...but its hard to mymic, the model doesn''t really have the person to person feel Avedon was so good at catching....this maybe is because u were the model and photographer? (possible?). i can''t say for sure but there is something really lacking that Avedon always had. and its more important than pose which u have, or even then lighting which u have in a very clean refined form. don''t worry it won''t hurt your vote any. but it would be nice it there were that extra pop of photog. model emotional interaction which send such a clear image and message through the photo.</td>', 'lol, not bad not bad at all. as far as the photo goes pretty much did it. i think there is something missing that Avedon always had...but its hard to mymic, the model doesn''t really have the person to person feel Avedon was so good at catching....this maybe is because u were the model and photographer? (possible?). i can''t say for sure but there is something really lacking that Avedon always had. and its more important than pose which u have, or even then lighting which u have in a very clean refined form. don''t worry it won''t hurt your vote any. but it would be nice it there were that extra pop of photog. model emotional interaction which send such a clear image and message through the photo.', '2006-01-25 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
