(2080856, 285008, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely done tribute photo in the style of the photographer. Excellent choice to photograph and enter. Well processed. Thanks.</td>', 'Nicely done tribute photo in the style of the photographer. Excellent choice to photograph and enter. Well processed. Thanks.', '2006-01-25 02:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080859, 285759, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, Joel-Peter does some pretty weird and creepy stuff!  Your picture does him justice!  :-)  I note most of his pics have several elements or themes and are somewhat chaotic, your pic is somewhat simplistic in nature - although the image is rather haunting.  Nice interpretation of his work!</td>', 'Wow, Joel-Peter does some pretty weird and creepy stuff!  Your picture does him justice!  :-)  I note most of his pics have several elements or themes and are somewhat chaotic, your pic is somewhat simplistic in nature - although the image is rather haunting.  Nice interpretation of his work!', '2006-01-25 02:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080863, 285279, 37893, '<td valign="top">The image needs a bit of sharpening. It seems too soft. 5</td>', 'The image needs a bit of sharpening. It seems too soft. 5', '2006-01-25 02:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080870, 284836, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ah, going for the Andy Warhol look!  Nice tribute to Mapplethorpe, well done.</td>', 'Ah, going for the Andy Warhol look!  Nice tribute to Mapplethorpe, well done.', '2006-01-25 02:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080875, 285485, 34938, '<td valign="top">spectacular sky...nice shot</td>', 'spectacular sky...nice shot', '2006-01-25 02:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080880, 285660, 34938, '<td valign="top">wonderful...this should do well</td>', 'wonderful...this should do well', '2006-01-25 02:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080881, 284567, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great tribute to Andrzej!  I note in his work that even though the images are very processed, they still possess a humanistic tonality to them (particularly in the skin tones).  You image almost comes across more as a painting, slightly over-sharpened and contrasty.  However, no points off for that!  Some great PS work here!!</td>', 'Great tribute to Andrzej!  I note in his work that even though the images are very processed, they still possess a humanistic tonality to them (particularly in the skin tones).  You image almost comes across more as a painting, slightly over-sharpened and contrasty.  However, no points off for that!  Some great PS work here!!', '2006-01-25 02:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080889, 284836, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent tribute photo in the style of the photographer. It''s probably not the style that''s the most (in)famous but true nonetheless. Well conceived, composed and executed. Love the expression on modle''s face and the way you''ve cuaght it.</td>', 'Excellent tribute photo in the style of the photographer. It''s probably not the style that''s the most (in)famous but true nonetheless. Well conceived, composed and executed. Love the expression on modle''s face and the way you''ve cuaght it.', '2006-01-25 02:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080896, 285656, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love Mapplethorpe and his work and the lillies would be one of his. Love the background here, the compositiona and particularly the cyc light</td>', 'Love Mapplethorpe and his work and the lillies would be one of his. Love the background here, the compositiona and particularly the cyc light', '2006-01-25 02:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080904, 285734, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good tribute, true to the genre and a fine image in its own right</td>', 'Good tribute, true to the genre and a fine image in its own right', '2006-01-25 02:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080905, 283710, 18197, '<td valign="top">Some of Walter Wick''s best work is his surrealist art/photography. This is an excellent tribute photo in that style. My congratulations to you on conceiving, and executing such a fine photo. Among my top picks!</td>', 'Some of Walter Wick''s best work is his surrealist art/photography. This is an excellent tribute photo in that style. My congratulations to you on conceiving, and executing such a fine photo. Among my top picks!', '2006-01-25 02:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080906, 284894, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and right on as a tribute</td>', 'This is a great photo and right on as a tribute', '2006-01-25 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080911, 285283, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo and I gave it a good score. But it doesn''t seem very representative of Winogrand''s work that I can find on the internet.</td>', 'This is a very good photo and I gave it a good score. But it doesn''t seem very representative of Winogrand''s work that I can find on the internet.', '2006-01-25 02:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080912, 285313, 42984, '<td valign="top">Who''s the tribute to? I love this pic although it looks a little fuzzy on the subjects but it has such a wonderful story. Pity about the tibute</td>', 'Who''s the tribute to? I love this pic although it looks a little fuzzy on the subjects but it has such a wonderful story. Pity about the tibute', '2006-01-25 02:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080918, 284418, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not an especially well known photographer (at least to me) but it''s a lovely photo which seems to have some roots in the photographer''s work. Composition, lighting, focus DOF anr all well executed. I like the triangle formed by the blossoms and the rock. Black background works well. Thanks.</td>', 'Not an especially well known photographer (at least to me) but it''s a lovely photo which seems to have some roots in the photographer''s work. Composition, lighting, focus DOF anr all well executed. I like the triangle formed by the blossoms and the rock. Black background works well. Thanks.', '2006-01-25 02:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080927, 283947, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great tribute to Abotts work.</td>', 'Great tribute to Abotts work.', '2006-01-25 02:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080928, 285562, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but I can''t find anything similar on the internet by a photographer named Michael Mowery.</td>', 'Nice photo but I can''t find anything similar on the internet by a photographer named Michael Mowery.', '2006-01-25 02:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080942, 285312, 18197, '<td valign="top">This seems to me to be a nice tribute photo to the photographer but representative of only a small part of his work. I like the drama, and I like the contrasty nature of the photo. Otherwise, it''s a bit overprocessed for my taste. Don''t let my POV trouble you. It''s a great photo and I hope it does well inthe voting.</td>', 'This seems to me to be a nice tribute photo to the photographer but representative of only a small part of his work. I like the drama, and I like the contrasty nature of the photo. Otherwise, it''s a bit overprocessed for my taste. Don''t let my POV trouble you. It''s a great photo and I hope it does well inthe voting.', '2006-01-25 02:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080945, 285213, 42984, '<td valign="top">3399 don''t understand399e title but the photo is great and the tribute to Annie is appropriate</td>', '3399 don''t understand399e title but the photo is great and the tribute to Annie is appropriate', '2006-01-25 02:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080948, 285689, 42984, '<td valign="top">Who''s the tribute to?</td>', 'Who''s the tribute to?', '2006-01-25 02:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080954, 285635, 245, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite photographers! Woot!</td>', 'One of my favorite photographers! Woot!', '2006-01-25 02:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080956, 284972, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is such a convincing tribute, I for a minute thought is was his work :)</td>', 'This is such a convincing tribute, I for a minute thought is was his work :)', '2006-01-25 02:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080964, 285594, 18197, '<td valign="top">Composition is similar to Schoeller''s although not portrait which is more common. Plain face with lots of character works well and in style. Missing catch lights I see in the eyes of Schoeller''s work. Focus and sharpness is a little off. All this sounds negative ... and I don''t mean it to. It is among my top picks in spite of the critique.</td>', 'Composition is similar to Schoeller''s although not portrait which is more common. Plain face with lots of character works well and in style. Missing catch lights I see in the eyes of Schoeller''s work. Focus and sharpness is a little off. All this sounds negative ... and I don''t mean it to. It is among my top picks in spite of the critique.', '2006-01-25 02:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080968, 285700, 42984, '<td valign="top">Who''s the tribute to? This is a disturbing image and title, my first 1</td>', 'Who''s the tribute to? This is a disturbing image and title, my first 1', '2006-01-25 02:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080969, 284894, 37893, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. I like the mix of the reds and oranges in sunset shots! There is some artifacting that is happening to the bottom right but I doubt most will see. My recommendation to make this a better shot is to locate the horizon using the rule of thirds ;)</td>', 'Lovely colors. I like the mix of the reds and oranges in sunset shots! There is some artifacting that is happening to the bottom right but I doubt most will see. My recommendation to make this a better shot is to locate the horizon using the rule of thirds ;)', '2006-01-25 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080971, 283775, 42984, '<td valign="top">Terrific tribute to a great photog</td>', 'Terrific tribute to a great photog', '2006-01-25 02:49:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2080972, 285700, 30861, '<td valign="top">I had no idea what this image was about until someone I was chatting with happened to mention Andres Serrano''s "Piss Christ", so I looked it up. You just jumped from a 5 to an 8. It''s an excellent tribute to the original, plus you got cojones even doing this in the first place. I''m sorry you didn''t include the photog''s name in your title, I think very few people are going to get this, though I may be wrong.</td>', 'I had no idea what this image was about until someone I was chatting with happened to mention Andres Serrano''s "Piss Christ", so I looked it up. You just jumped from a 5 to an 8. It''s an excellent tribute to the original, plus you got cojones even doing this in the first place. I''m sorry you didn''t include the photog''s name in your title, I think very few people are going to get this, though I may be wrong.', '2006-01-25 02:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080973, 285439, 42984, '<td valign="top">Who''s the tribute to?</td>', 'Who''s the tribute to?', '2006-01-25 02:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080974, 283972, 37893, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! The use of a wide angle helps this image sing out loud! I love the tones and the contrast of this image. Great shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot! The use of a wide angle helps this image sing out loud! I love the tones and the contrast of this image. Great shot.', '2006-01-25 02:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080975, 283829, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great pic. Who''s the tribute to?</td>', 'Great pic. Who''s the tribute to?', '2006-01-25 02:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080976, 285575, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tribute photo in the style of Penn. I really like how you have "un-aged" Picasso and kept the style, composition, lighting, focus, and DOF of his Picasso photo. Well done ... possibly best of show.</td>', 'Wonderful tribute photo in the style of Penn. I really like how you have "un-aged" Picasso and kept the style, composition, lighting, focus, and DOF of his Picasso photo. Well done ... possibly best of show.', '2006-01-25 02:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080979, 285589, 37893, '<td valign="top">A touching tribute. Anne Gedes typically shoots in bright spaces and hardly ever uses black backgrounds. However, my score is not based on that but based on your image in itself. First it''s a tad small so you''ll receive many comments about this. I wish that the baby was looking my direction instead of looking up as my eye is drawn to it. Good luck!</td>', 'A touching tribute. Anne Gedes typically shoots in bright spaces and hardly ever uses black backgrounds. However, my score is not based on that but based on your image in itself. First it''s a tad small so you''ll receive many comments about this. I wish that the baby was looking my direction instead of looking up as my eye is drawn to it. Good luck!', '2006-01-25 02:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080985, 283699, 37893, '<td valign="top">Well you definitely have the large angry clouds that he is known for ;) I think to improve this image, I would have used portrait instead of landscape. The portrait orientation would make the falls seem even taller and would crop out the branches to the lower rigt which is a bit distracting. Great capture. 6</td>', 'Well you definitely have the large angry clouds that he is known for ;) I think to improve this image, I would have used portrait instead of landscape. The portrait orientation would make the falls seem even taller and would crop out the branches to the lower rigt which is a bit distracting. Great capture. 6', '2006-01-25 02:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2080987, 285469, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very very well done. A virtual copy Dragan''s photo. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Very very well done. A virtual copy Dragan''s photo. Among my top picks.', '2006-01-25 02:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
