(2081262, 285486, 17507, '<td valign="top">Composition is very nice. Processing-wise, this is close, but not quite right for an AA tribute. The horizon line has a visible glow from processing and the blacks and whites are just a bit too solid to the point of detail loss. A more carefully reprocessed version would be a nice thing to see.</td>', 'Composition is very nice. Processing-wise, this is close, but not quite right for an AA tribute. The horizon line has a visible glow from processing and the blacks and whites are just a bit too solid to the point of detail loss. A more carefully reprocessed version would be a nice thing to see.', '2006-01-25 03:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
