(2081941, 284988, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning light.  I like the smooth toes of the skin.  I can see this done by him for sure.</td>', 'Stunning light.  I like the smooth toes of the skin.  I can see this done by him for sure.', '2006-01-25 08:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
