(2082002, 285734, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I''d clone out the nose hair.  Seems a tad yellowish.  Also I''d make sure the fingernail didn''t have a week''s worth of growth to it.  His work is tack sharp, and rich in color.  Keep trying!!</td>', 'I think I''d clone out the nose hair.  Seems a tad yellowish.  Also I''d make sure the fingernail didn''t have a week''s worth of growth to it.  His work is tack sharp, and rich in color.  Keep trying!!', '2006-01-25 09:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
