(2082118, 283957, 43753, '<td valign="top">I really like the inimate feel of this photograph - the way you bring us so close to the subject.</td>', 'I really like the inimate feel of this photograph - the way you bring us so close to the subject.', '2006-01-25 09:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
