(2082755, 285308, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I can''t find anything is crisp focus ... maybe that was not your intent but it would be my preference. The background distracts me from your subject.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I can''t find anything is crisp focus ... maybe that was not your intent but it would be my preference. The background distracts me from your subject.', '2006-01-25 12:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
