(2082771, 285749, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. This is actually a well executed photo ... probably better than it will score in the voting here. Composition is interesting.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. This is actually a well executed photo ... probably better than it will score in the voting here. Composition is interesting.', '2006-01-25 12:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082779, 285700, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I actually like this image as an abstract. DOF is interesting. Texture is interesting. Title diminishes the work, IMO.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I actually like this image as an abstract. DOF is interesting. Texture is interesting. Title diminishes the work, IMO.', '2006-01-25 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082790, 285325, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. This subject has been photographed many many times. To compare well with the genre, I would suggest brightening the image somewhat, increasing the saturation, and greater DOF. These may not have been your intent but they are my preferences.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. This subject has been photographed many many times. To compare well with the genre, I would suggest brightening the image somewhat, increasing the saturation, and greater DOF. These may not have been your intent but they are my preferences.', '2006-01-25 12:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082793, 285485, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Sky is terrific. Ground is not. In advanced editing, you could have given us more light on the mountains without blowing the sky. That would have improved my reaction tot he photo I think.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Sky is terrific. Ground is not. In advanced editing, you could have given us more light on the mountains without blowing the sky. That would have improved my reaction tot he photo I think.', '2006-01-25 12:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082804, 285479, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case unless it''s Edgerton. Would that be right? I would prefer to see the image without the border ... it is the image that is interesting but almost a quarter of the frame is consumed with the border which adds no interest for me.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case unless it''s Edgerton. Would that be right? I would prefer to see the image without the border ... it is the image that is interesting but almost a quarter of the frame is consumed with the border which adds no interest for me.', '2006-01-25 12:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082810, 285439, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. It seems to me you have tried to convey color and broad form in an almost abstract image. To my eye, it is not abstract enough to pull that off and therefore my eye is looking for something in sharp focus and I can''t find anything.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. It seems to me you have tried to convey color and broad form in an almost abstract image. To my eye, it is not abstract enough to pull that off and therefore my eye is looking for something in sharp focus and I can''t find anything.', '2006-01-25 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082813, 285602, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Lovely girl. Nice focus on the eyes. Good range of color and light levels.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Lovely girl. Nice focus on the eyes. Good range of color and light levels.', '2006-01-25 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082817, 285473, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I would <b>really</b> like to see this bigger. If the image will stand it without deteriorating into pixels, I would have preferred this at 640 X 488.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I would really like to see this bigger. If the image will stand it without deteriorating into pixels, I would have preferred this at 640 X 488.', '2006-01-25 12:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082822, 284618, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. This is a well enough executed photo but the genre doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. This is a well enough executed photo but the genre doesn''t appeal to me.', '2006-01-25 12:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082826, 285631, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Your photo is well and appropriately titled. It conveys the emotion of disrepair at several levels.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Your photo is well and appropriately titled. It conveys the emotion of disrepair at several levels.', '2006-01-25 12:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082829, 284694, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Nice image which I would have given a couple of more point to if I knew who you were emulating.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Nice image which I would have given a couple of more point to if I knew who you were emulating.', '2006-01-25 13:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082832, 284941, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Composition feels a bit cramped on the bottom and the left. In contrast to the white background, richer tones in the strap would have improved my reaction to your photo.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Composition feels a bit cramped on the bottom and the left. In contrast to the white background, richer tones in the strap would have improved my reaction to your photo.', '2006-01-25 13:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082846, 285735, 21714, '<td valign="top">A fine composition and I see the clear connection. Well done.</td>', 'A fine composition and I see the clear connection. Well done.', '2006-01-25 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082849, 285211, 46634, '<td valign="top">not sure adding an image is allowed under Advanced Editing - creates a major element.  If so, great photo.</td>', 'not sure adding an image is allowed under Advanced Editing - creates a major element.  If so, great photo.', '2006-01-25 13:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082855, 285411, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Otherwise this is a terrific candid photo. It conveys very well the attitude that I have come to associate as French chic ... stylish, arrogant, self absorbed ... and I don''t mean this in a bad way but more as a behavioral style. I like the high point of view. I like the angle. Focus could be a little better. I have lost some detail on the subjects but can read the Belgacom ADSL boxes. Since this is advanced editing, I might have brightened the people a bit ... not so much that you lose them in the background but enough to give me a little more detail in their clothing. These may not have been your intention but they would be my preferences.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Otherwise this is a terrific candid photo. It conveys very well the attitude that I have come to associate as French chic ... stylish, arrogant, self absorbed ... and I don''t mean this in a bad way but more as a behavioral style. I like the high point of view. I like the angle. Focus could be a little better. I have lost some detail on the subjects but can read the Belgacom ADSL boxes. Since this is advanced editing, I might have brightened the people a bit ... not so much that you lose them in the background but enough to give me a little more detail in their clothing. These may not have been your intention but they would be my preferences.', '2006-01-25 13:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082860, 285629, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Otherwise this is a beautiful photo. Lightig, contrast, color, DOF are all superb. I probably would have given it 4 more points if it compared well with whomever you are emulating.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Otherwise this is a beautiful photo. Lightig, contrast, color, DOF are all superb. I probably would have given it 4 more points if it compared well with whomever you are emulating.', '2006-01-25 13:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082862, 283829, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Photo conveys a certain dramatic tension which I like.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Photo conveys a certain dramatic tension which I like.', '2006-01-25 13:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2082869, 285597, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Creative idea and point of view. Composition is good but a little tight in the frame. Focus on the eye is good. DOF feels a little to shallow ... or a little too deep, I''m not sure which. Color doesn''t help the image for me.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. Creative idea and point of view. Composition is good but a little tight in the frame. Focus on the eye is good. DOF feels a little to shallow ... or a little too deep, I''m not sure which. Color doesn''t help the image for me.', '2006-01-25 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
