(2083063, 285602, 5792, '<td valign="top">What makes this one of the best images in this challene is the shallow focus combined with the perfect focus on the right side eye. High technical quality.</td>', 'What makes this one of the best images in this challene is the shallow focus combined with the perfect focus on the right side eye. High technical quality.', '2006-01-25 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
