(2083073, 284567, 5792, '<td valign="top">One fine image that captures this man''s gritty life. The slight oversharpness fits the composition well.</td>', 'One fine image that captures this man''s gritty life. The slight oversharpness fits the composition well.', '2006-01-25 14:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
