(2084212, 285283, 35804, '<td valign="top">I have to say that Garry Winogrand is probably one of my very favorite photographers...and quite honestly, IMO, this image doesn''t bring his work to mind. When I think Winogrand, I think mid-century candids, people...images that have an almost vernacular quality about them and often a bit of humor...not high contrast building facades. This is an interesting image but I just don''t see any "Winogrand" in it.</td>', 'I have to say that Garry Winogrand is probably one of my very favorite photographers...and quite honestly, IMO, this image doesn''t bring his work to mind. When I think Winogrand, I think mid-century candids, people...images that have an almost vernacular quality about them and often a bit of humor...not high contrast building facades. This is an interesting image but I just don''t see any "Winogrand" in it.', '2006-01-25 18:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
