(2084502, 283184, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I like your photo quite a bit. The bold vibrant primary colors are attractive. Saturation works well. I like the foreground-background shapes. If I knew whose style you''re emulating and if I could determine if it was representative, I could have given this photo 3-4 more points in my vote.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I like your photo quite a bit. The bold vibrant primary colors are attractive. Saturation works well. I like the foreground-background shapes. If I knew whose style you''re emulating and if I could determine if it was representative, I could have given this photo 3-4 more points in my vote.', '2006-01-25 19:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2084510, 285753, 18197, '<td valign="top">Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I actually like this photo quite a bit. Focus and lighting on the subject is quite good. DOF was well chosen. If I knew whose style you were emulating and if I could determine it''s representative, I could have scored this image 2-3 points higher.</td>', 'Part of the fun of the challenge is comparing the photos to the work of the photographers they''re paying tribute to. I can''t figure out who that would be in this case. I actually like this photo quite a bit. Focus and lighting on the subject is quite good. DOF was well chosen. If I knew whose style you were emulating and if I could determine it''s representative, I could have scored this image 2-3 points higher.', '2006-01-25 19:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
