(2084944, 285743, 37893, '<td valign="top">Ahhh I am quite familiar with his work. This is a good adaptation of his "ballerina" pieces. The tones are good with an improvement with an adjustment of levels. One word of improvement is to allow the hands and foot to be in the frame of the image as opposed to being "cut-off".</td>', 'Ahhh I am quite familiar with his work. This is a good adaptation of his "ballerina" pieces. The tones are good with an improvement with an adjustment of levels. One word of improvement is to allow the hands and foot to be in the frame of the image as opposed to being "cut-off".', '2006-01-25 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2084946, 285317, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sepia toning to create an old feel to this image. The burning of the edges adds an extra flavor to the impact of this image.</td>', 'Nice use of sepia toning to create an old feel to this image. The burning of the edges adds an extra flavor to the impact of this image.', '2006-01-25 21:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2084951, 284164, 37893, '<td valign="top">I like this old feel look of this BW. the contrast levels are just right that nothing stands out too much. As an improvement to this image, may I suggest that a new layer be created where you can lighten the shadows and midtones of the structure to the left. It''s just a tad dark right now.</td>', 'I like this old feel look of this BW. the contrast levels are just right that nothing stands out too much. As an improvement to this image, may I suggest that a new layer be created where you can lighten the shadows and midtones of the structure to the left. It''s just a tad dark right now.', '2006-01-25 21:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085051, 284688, 37893, '<td valign="top">Ahh this image is perfect. I don''t think I would change a thing. Great capture and clean lines throughout. 7 but subject to bumping up ;)</td>', 'Ahh this image is perfect. I don''t think I would change a thing. Great capture and clean lines throughout. 7 but subject to bumping up ;)', '2006-01-25 22:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085059, 284923, 37893, '<td valign="top">Good capture though the image seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Good capture though the image seems a bit soft.', '2006-01-25 22:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085066, 284708, 37893, '<td valign="top">Seems like you used your eraser tool to remove something on the right side of the photo. I can see it clearly. I think the focus on this image is great and I like the look of seeing the light strobe in her eyes. Great job on that one. What distracts me though is the background. If it were pure white, I think this would have been a stronger image. 6</td>', 'Seems like you used your eraser tool to remove something on the right side of the photo. I can see it clearly. I think the focus on this image is great and I like the look of seeing the light strobe in her eyes. Great job on that one. What distracts me though is the background. If it were pure white, I think this would have been a stronger image. 6', '2006-01-25 22:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085069, 285244, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and abstraction. You almost want to say "Wheeee!".</td>', 'Nice colors and abstraction. You almost want to say "Wheeee!".', '2006-01-25 22:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085073, 285629, 37893, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the great use of DOF here.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the great use of DOF here.', '2006-01-25 22:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085076, 283834, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this image suffers from a lack of contrast and the "tilt" effect. The whole building is leaning towards the left. A quick rotation to the right would have fixed this problem.</td>', 'I think this image suffers from a lack of contrast and the "tilt" effect. The whole building is leaning towards the left. A quick rotation to the right would have fixed this problem.', '2006-01-25 22:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085149, 285519, 13688, '<td valign="top">extremely well done</td>', 'extremely well done', '2006-01-25 22:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2085261, 285735, 25397, '<td valign="top">extremely well done, as I''ve said before the person walking behind them reminds me of pure doisneau<br/> <br/>so many layers of things to look at, would look great on a cafe wall</td>', 'extremely well done, as I''ve said before the person walking behind them reminds me of pure doisneau so many layers of things to look at, would look great on a cafe wall', '2006-01-25 22:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
