(2085497, 283775, 30982, '<td valign="top">A wee bit soft - Cartier-Bresson''s work strikes me as being very sharply focused.  Nice composition of the image!</td>', 'A wee bit soft - Cartier-Bresson''s work strikes me as being very sharply focused.  Nice composition of the image!', '2006-01-25 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
