(2088433, 285425, 42100, '<td valign="top">So many photographers I''m not familiar with, makes it difficult to say how well they are tributed.  Excellent photograph, I love the contrast and detail.  Based on your photograph this is a photographer I''m going to have to look into.  Great job!</td>', 'So many photographers I''m not familiar with, makes it difficult to say how well they are tributed.  Excellent photograph, I love the contrast and detail.  Based on your photograph this is a photographer I''m going to have to look into.  Great job!', '2006-01-26 14:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
