(2088451, 285753, 42100, '<td valign="top">Forgive me for my ignorance of who the photographer is that your tributing.  I tend to be more of a landscape person, so I''m getting some great lessons on some the art type photographers.  You''re photo on its oown merit is great.  I love the story telling aspect of this photo.  Good contrast and tones also.  Well done!</td>', 'Forgive me for my ignorance of who the photographer is that your tributing.  I tend to be more of a landscape person, so I''m getting some great lessons on some the art type photographers.  You''re photo on its oown merit is great.  I love the story telling aspect of this photo.  Good contrast and tones also.  Well done!', '2006-01-26 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
