(2088454, 284196, 42100, '<td valign="top">I don''t know anything about Nitsche, but you''re photo is very good.  I find the mainly cool tones with the reflected warm tones in the glass very interesting.  Very nice!</td>', 'I don''t know anything about Nitsche, but you''re photo is very good.  I find the mainly cool tones with the reflected warm tones in the glass very interesting.  Very nice!', '2006-01-26 14:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
