(2088515, 285519, 42100, '<td valign="top">Again, another photographer I haven''t heard of.  But I guess that''s what is making this challenge so great.  This photo is great, the subject is just some everyday ordinary look out any old office window, but you made it so much more.  Great composition and excellent highlights.  Very nice!</td>', 'Again, another photographer I haven''t heard of.  But I guess that''s what is making this challenge so great.  This photo is great, the subject is just some everyday ordinary look out any old office window, but you made it so much more.  Great composition and excellent highlights.  Very nice!', '2006-01-26 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
