(2088912, 284589, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very effort. I would have chosen simpler pattern tiles for the yellow to avoid the eyes examining the white cloud like pattern on the yellow. That is, the definition here is wanting because the form is rather indistinct and this does draw the eye. Everything else is nice, the black and white tiles and the feet present. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is a very effort. I would have chosen simpler pattern tiles for the yellow to avoid the eyes examining the white cloud like pattern on the yellow. That is, the definition here is wanting because the form is rather indistinct and this does draw the eye. Everything else is nice, the black and white tiles and the feet present. Bumping up.', '2006-01-26 16:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
