(2089322, 284871, 48890, '<td valign="top">Composition-wise, usually it''s best to have the face in the right part of the frame, not the left.</td>', 'Composition-wise, usually it''s best to have the face in the right part of the frame, not the left.', '2006-01-26 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
