(2089381, 284224, 48890, '<td valign="top">The BG is overexposed, and I think that this only came as a consequence of a difficult exposure conditions (dark inside, bright outside).  COnsidering the BG is taking so much of the frame, I don''t think that this overexposure is acceptable in this image.  Regardless of the exposure issue, the composition of this shot is a bit dead-on. I had a look at //www.eirikjohnson.com/, and, in my opinion, the photographer usually finds more interesting pespectives and makes more careful exposures than this picture.</td>', 'The BG is overexposed, and I think that this only came as a consequence of a difficult exposure conditions (dark inside, bright outside).  COnsidering the BG is taking so much of the frame, I don''t think that this overexposure is acceptable in this image.  Regardless of the exposure issue, the composition of this shot is a bit dead-on. I had a look at //www.eirikjohnson.com/, and, in my opinion, the photographer usually finds more interesting pespectives and makes more careful exposures than this picture.', '2006-01-26 18:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089393, 285641, 48890, '<td valign="top">Not sure who you are attributing here...  I think that the colours are a bit too cold, bleak, and the shadow cast on the trunk of the tree on the right is regretable.</td>', 'Not sure who you are attributing here...  I think that the colours are a bit too cold, bleak, and the shadow cast on the trunk of the tree on the right is regretable.', '2006-01-26 18:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
