(2089681, 285492, 43753, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is the kind of stuff htat disturbs me, but I must keep looking. Well done. I love it.</td>', 'Wow, this is the kind of stuff htat disturbs me, but I must keep looking. Well done. I love it.', '2006-01-26 19:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089684, 285411, 43753, '<td valign="top">How posh and hip this couple looks. Love the angle. Your composition rocks.</td>', 'How posh and hip this couple looks. Love the angle. Your composition rocks.', '2006-01-26 19:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089691, 285446, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and bright, almost like a painting.</td>', 'Very colorful and bright, almost like a painting.', '2006-01-26 19:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089694, 285599, 43753, '<td valign="top">WOnderful textures. I really love the lighting.</td>', 'WOnderful textures. I really love the lighting.', '2006-01-26 19:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089698, 283320, 43753, '<td valign="top">I realy like the cactus shot against a black background, and I love the detail in the spins. Very sharp.</td>', 'I realy like the cactus shot against a black background, and I love the detail in the spins. Very sharp.', '2006-01-26 19:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089702, 283734, 43753, '<td valign="top">How bare yet beautiful the old stumps look. Like an old married couple on the beach. I love the tone too. The scrub in the background adds a nice touch to the composition.</td>', 'How bare yet beautiful the old stumps look. Like an old married couple on the beach. I love the tone too. The scrub in the background adds a nice touch to the composition.', '2006-01-26 19:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089711, 285734, 43753, '<td valign="top">I really like the gold in the glitter paired with the golden hair and golden tone of the models short. Nice pink touch in the lips - excellent softness here too. Very creative.</td>', 'I really like the gold in the glitter paired with the golden hair and golden tone of the models short. Nice pink touch in the lips - excellent softness here too. Very creative.', '2006-01-26 19:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089712, 284433, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very urban landscape! The inclusion of the grass in the foreground is wonderful. THe clouds are erfect, and your lines are great. Well done.</td>', 'Very urban landscape! The inclusion of the grass in the foreground is wonderful. THe clouds are erfect, and your lines are great. Well done.', '2006-01-26 19:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089717, 285363, 43753, '<td valign="top">I see happiness, wisdom, and love in these eyes. Great tones and framing. Well done.</td>', 'I see happiness, wisdom, and love in these eyes. Great tones and framing. Well done.', '2006-01-26 19:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089719, 285345, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Very moving.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Very moving.', '2006-01-26 19:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089722, 285656, 49561, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2006-01-26 19:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089723, 285718, 49561, '<td valign="top">Very nice BW.</td>', 'Very nice BW.', '2006-01-26 19:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089730, 285700, 43753, '<td valign="top">I admire your courage and creativity with this shot. I was amazed at the ruckus that your inspiration ''Piss Christ'' raised. I am curious as to what your score will be. I give you a 10!</td>', 'I admire your courage and creativity with this shot. I was amazed at the ruckus that your inspiration ''Piss Christ'' raised. I am curious as to what your score will be. I give you a 10!', '2006-01-26 20:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089733, 285486, 49561, '<td valign="top">Nice BW image and tones.</td>', 'Nice BW image and tones.', '2006-01-26 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089734, 285313, 43753, '<td valign="top">How great is this. What feeling. The image really tells a story. My favorite part is the long shadow. Very nice shot.</td>', 'How great is this. What feeling. The image really tells a story. My favorite part is the long shadow. Very nice shot.', '2006-01-26 20:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089737, 284159, 43753, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. It is soft yet very detailed. Almost like a wonderland. Excellent composition. Great use of reflection.</td>', 'This is wonderful. It is soft yet very detailed. Almost like a wonderland. Excellent composition. Great use of reflection.', '2006-01-26 20:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089739, 284694, 49561, '<td valign="top">Very sensual ;)</td>', 'Very sensual ;)', '2006-01-26 20:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089740, 284118, 43753, '<td valign="top">Long exposure with those clouds produced quite a resul for you. Excellent work. Love the lights.</td>', 'Long exposure with those clouds produced quite a resul for you. Excellent work. Love the lights.', '2006-01-26 20:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089744, 285283, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice urban, grainy feel to this B&amp;W. A little distortion on the left side, but not enough to really detract from the overall composition. I love the shadows on the brick cast by the windows.</td>', 'Nice urban, grainy feel to this B&W. A little distortion on the left side, but not enough to really detract from the overall composition. I love the shadows on the brick cast by the windows.', '2006-01-26 20:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089756, 285418, 30982, '<td valign="top">The smoothness of the water and the contrast you caught in the snow is very good.  I do tend to equate Adams'' work with larger venues, though.</td>', 'The smoothness of the water and the contrast you caught in the snow is very good.  I do tend to equate Adams'' work with larger venues, though.', '2006-01-26 20:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089764, 284661, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good depth and clarity on the face but the collar lost a little detail.  Great expression!</td>', 'Good depth and clarity on the face but the collar lost a little detail.  Great expression!', '2006-01-26 20:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089773, 285635, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely see the link to photographer - nice!</td>', 'Definitely see the link to photographer - nice!', '2006-01-26 20:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089774, 285254, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll guess this is Ansel Adams?</td>', 'I''ll guess this is Ansel Adams?', '2006-01-26 20:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089776, 284643, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wow, two Kertesz tributes, I''ve never even heard of him.  His style must be watching people from above, or at least what I deduct from tributes.  Very interesting setting and subject.  Something odd seems to be going on with the pixels, perhaps to much crop or sharpening.</td>', 'Wow, two Kertesz tributes, I''ve never even heard of him.  His style must be watching people from above, or at least what I deduct from tributes.  Very interesting setting and subject.  Something odd seems to be going on with the pixels, perhaps to much crop or sharpening.', '2006-01-26 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089777, 285211, 30982, '<td valign="top">Intriguing stuff by that photographer and a very good tribute shot!  Looking forward to seeing how you did it.</td>', 'Intriguing stuff by that photographer and a very good tribute shot!  Looking forward to seeing how you did it.', '2006-01-26 20:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089783, 283382, 48890, '<td valign="top">Beautiful geometry and lighting in this shot.  I really like how it fills the frame.</td>', 'Beautiful geometry and lighting in this shot.  I really like how it fills the frame.', '2006-01-26 20:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089784, 285117, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting, exposition, and model''s pose.  Fantastic!</td>', 'Great composition, lighting, exposition, and model''s pose.  Fantastic!', '2006-01-26 20:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089785, 285738, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice, moody shot.  I like the perspective and the intrigue.</td>', 'Nice, moody shot.  I like the perspective and the intrigue.', '2006-01-26 20:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089791, 285694, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great over-the-edge genre shot. Lighting, exposure, composition are perfect.</td>', 'Great over-the-edge genre shot. Lighting, exposure, composition are perfect.', '2006-01-26 20:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089792, 284540, 48890, '<td valign="top">Very nicely exhagerated (sp?) colours.  I like this shot.</td>', 'Very nicely exhagerated (sp?) colours.  I like this shot.', '2006-01-26 20:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089798, 285732, 48890, '<td valign="top">Very nice technique and great colours.</td>', 'Very nice technique and great colours.', '2006-01-26 20:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089801, 284891, 48890, '<td valign="top">This is very much Ansel-like.</td>', 'This is very much Ansel-like.', '2006-01-26 20:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089803, 285244, 42100, '<td valign="top">Well this challenge has definately an education.  I''m definately going to get my nose out of the landscape photographer books and into the art photographer books.  If Presti''s work is anything like this it must be very interesting.  I love bold colors in your whirl, the composition is good as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Well this challenge has definately an education.  I''m definately going to get my nose out of the landscape photographer books and into the art photographer books.  If Presti''s work is anything like this it must be very interesting.  I love bold colors in your whirl, the composition is good as well.  Well done!', '2006-01-26 20:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089804, 284990, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hadn''t heard of him - gosh, he does nice work - thanks for the introduction!  Your tribute photograph seems to be a bit more vibrant than the general tone of Mr Neill''s work, but it''s a very nice capture.</td>', 'Hadn''t heard of him - gosh, he does nice work - thanks for the introduction!  Your tribute photograph seems to be a bit more vibrant than the general tone of Mr Neill''s work, but it''s a very nice capture.', '2006-01-26 20:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089806, 285085, 30982, '<td valign="top">Appropriate to the challenge and the photographer - nice.</td>', 'Appropriate to the challenge and the photographer - nice.', '2006-01-26 20:28:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2089825, 283454, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can see the style in your picture quite well.  It''s a little too overbright, though - with a little less light (or processing?) there might be more detail in the leaves and a softer background.</td>', 'I can see the style in your picture quite well.  It''s a little too overbright, though - with a little less light (or processing?) there might be more detail in the leaves and a softer background.', '2006-01-26 20:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089834, 285690, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice softness to this picture!</td>', 'Nice softness to this picture!', '2006-01-26 20:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089836, 285287, 30982, '<td valign="top">But she''s clothed!  :-)</td>', 'But she''s clothed!  :-)', '2006-01-26 20:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089846, 285519, 30982, '<td valign="top">I see this as true to what I''ve read of the artist''s "vision" - extremely well done.</td>', 'I see this as true to what I''ve read of the artist''s "vision" - extremely well done.', '2006-01-26 20:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089848, 285482, 30982, '<td valign="top">Thanks - another great photographer I hadn''t known of before - and your work reflectes Toussaint''s depth and richness of color.  Very nice!</td>', 'Thanks - another great photographer I hadn''t known of before - and your work reflectes Toussaint''s depth and richness of color.  Very nice!', '2006-01-26 20:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089850, 283739, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice tribute.  If anything, the light on the right side of her face is a wee bit too bright.</td>', 'Nice tribute.  If anything, the light on the right side of her face is a wee bit too bright.', '2006-01-26 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089853, 285589, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of desat, and congrats on getting the infant to cooperate!  I suspect that''s half of Geddes'' talent.</td>', 'Nice use of desat, and congrats on getting the infant to cooperate!  I suspect that''s half of Geddes'' talent.', '2006-01-26 20:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089859, 285325, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure to whose work this is a tribute, but that''s OK.  It seems as though the focus is on the silver pitcher to the upper left - I''d have preferred a bit less shallow DOF, to get the grain in the center more in focus.</td>', 'I''m not sure to whose work this is a tribute, but that''s OK.  It seems as though the focus is on the silver pitcher to the upper left - I''d have preferred a bit less shallow DOF, to get the grain in the center more in focus.', '2006-01-26 20:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089862, 284570, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and a fitting tribute!</td>', 'Nice detail and a fitting tribute!', '2006-01-26 20:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089869, 285748, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think if you were going for Richard Avedon then this image has way too much contrast to truly portray his beautiful BW photos.</td>', 'I think if you were going for Richard Avedon then this image has way too much contrast to truly portray his beautiful BW photos.', '2006-01-26 20:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089876, 285451, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not all that fond of the border (you''ll probably hear this more than once), but it is a creative shot.</td>', 'I''m not all that fond of the border (you''ll probably hear this more than once), but it is a creative shot.', '2006-01-26 20:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089890, 284692, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good job - the picture reflects the softness of light nicely.</td>', 'Good job - the picture reflects the softness of light nicely.', '2006-01-26 21:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089897, 285638, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome crispness to this shot.</td>', 'Awesome crispness to this shot.', '2006-01-26 21:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089905, 285519, 43753, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition a lot. It looks well cnceived. I really like the direcional arows and the perspective from which the image was shot. The human element , the woman walking across, seems small yet the center of attention. Very, very goof work here.</td>', 'I really like this composition a lot. It looks well cnceived. I really like the direcional arows and the perspective from which the image was shot. The human element , the woman walking across, seems small yet the center of attention. Very, very goof work here.', '2006-01-26 21:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089906, 285085, 43753, '<td valign="top">MMmm! What I wouldn''t give to hear this music drifting out of the house. I like the simple county theme.</td>', 'MMmm! What I wouldn''t give to hear this music drifting out of the house. I like the simple county theme.', '2006-01-26 21:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089907, 285317, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice work here with the viginetting effect around the frame. I like the DOF</td>', 'Nice work here with the viginetting effect around the frame. I like the DOF', '2006-01-26 21:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089908, 285354, 43753, '<td valign="top">How beautiful this new like. So soft and warm.</td>', 'How beautiful this new like. So soft and warm.', '2006-01-26 21:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089910, 284923, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and framing using the tree and snowbank. I like the action the snow imaprts. Beautiful quiet winter scene.</td>', 'Nice comp and framing using the tree and snowbank. I like the action the snow imaprts. Beautiful quiet winter scene.', '2006-01-26 21:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089914, 285758, 43753, '<td valign="top">This is so different from the ther images I hae viewed so far. Very simple yet strong. Clean. Great use of shadow.</td>', 'This is so different from the ther images I hae viewed so far. Very simple yet strong. Clean. Great use of shadow.', '2006-01-26 21:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089915, 285196, 43753, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Very clean and crisp. Love the entire composition.</td>', 'Awesome. Very clean and crisp. Love the entire composition.', '2006-01-26 21:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089916, 283775, 43753, '<td valign="top">I love these life-shots. Very natural and unrehearsed.</td>', 'I love these life-shots. Very natural and unrehearsed.', '2006-01-26 21:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089918, 285694, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very sexy - mixing the masculine and the feminine. Excellent comp. Love the smoke.</td>', 'Very sexy - mixing the masculine and the feminine. Excellent comp. Love the smoke.', '2006-01-26 21:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089921, 284969, 43753, '<td valign="top">Anoter sexy Newton. Wonderful details and softness of skin.</td>', 'Anoter sexy Newton. Wonderful details and softness of skin.', '2006-01-26 21:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089925, 283947, 43753, '<td valign="top">Old meets new. Very smooth and clean. I really like the green frame around the window. Adds a little pep.</td>', 'Old meets new. Very smooth and clean. I really like the green frame around the window. Adds a little pep.', '2006-01-26 21:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089928, 285638, 50581, '<td valign="top">What is that???</td>', 'What is that???', '2006-01-26 21:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089930, 284031, 37893, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the more pre-eminent pet photographers around. I think you have captured the essence of his style. It reminds me of one of his pet portrait books that has a pug for the cover. This is quite wonderful and quirky. Gotta love it ;) As an improvement, may I suggest just adjusting the levels slightly so that the midtones and the shadows are bumped up. I think this will make for a stronger and wonderfully amusing shot!<br/> <br/>Linda: The many things you put your darlings through ;) Great shot and good job!</td>', 'Probably one of the more pre-eminent pet photographers around. I think you have captured the essence of his style. It reminds me of one of his pet portrait books that has a pug for the cover. This is quite wonderful and quirky. Gotta love it ;) As an improvement, may I suggest just adjusting the levels slightly so that the midtones and the shadows are bumped up. I think this will make for a stronger and wonderfully amusing shot! Linda: The many things you put your darlings through ;) Great shot and good job!', '2006-01-26 21:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089932, 284031, 50581, '<td valign="top">AWWWWWWWWWW How cute!</td>', 'AWWWWWWWWWW How cute!', '2006-01-26 21:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089942, 285750, 37893, '<td valign="top">My compliments to you for taking on such a tribute to one of DPC''s most admired and respected photographers. What it lacks in execution is strengthened by the concept and the drive to create an image worthy of Dan''s praise. Multiple exposures are extremely tricky to learn as I had found out. Congrats to you for trying and keep trying and continue the learning process. Great job!</td>', 'My compliments to you for taking on such a tribute to one of DPC''s most admired and respected photographers. What it lacks in execution is strengthened by the concept and the drive to create an image worthy of Dan''s praise. Multiple exposures are extremely tricky to learn as I had found out. Congrats to you for trying and keep trying and continue the learning process. Great job!', '2006-01-26 21:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089945, 285308, 50581, '<td valign="top">The focus is on her neck. Why? Was it supposed 2 be like that?</td>', 'The focus is on her neck. Why? Was it supposed 2 be like that?', '2006-01-26 21:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089948, 283820, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love his movies and his cinematography. Photos through the eyes of Warren Miller is best described by the photo that is in front of my screen. What a wonderful capture. The virgin snow, the dizzying heights, the pureness of the colors... all point to a man we all know so much. As a suggestion, the crop could be improved by placing the subject in the thirds and not so much to the right in addition to an adjustment of levels and curves. Great job and keep up the great work.</td>', 'I love his movies and his cinematography. Photos through the eyes of Warren Miller is best described by the photo that is in front of my screen. What a wonderful capture. The virgin snow, the dizzying heights, the pureness of the colors... all point to a man we all know so much. As a suggestion, the crop could be improved by placing the subject in the thirds and not so much to the right in addition to an adjustment of levels and curves. Great job and keep up the great work.', '2006-01-26 21:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089977, 285605, 50581, '<td valign="top">There''s no way 2 descibe it, I just love it!</td>', 'There''s no way 2 descibe it, I just love it!', '2006-01-26 21:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2089979, 284688, 50581, '<td valign="top">How did U do that? If its something simple, don''t laugh cuz I''m still learning. Please tell me, I like it.</td>', 'How did U do that? If its something simple, don''t laugh cuz I''m still learning. Please tell me, I like it.', '2006-01-26 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2090055, 284891, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the grandiosity of Adams'' work very well.  Sky is a bit noisy.</td>', 'You''ve captured the grandiosity of Adams'' work very well.  Sky is a bit noisy.', '2006-01-26 22:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2090081, 284602, 49773, '<td valign="top">"...Work Offers Considered: Paid and Limited TFP..." (from www). How much did you offer?<br/>Good shot, just cannot figure out to whom is the tribute?</td>', '"...Work Offers Considered: Paid and Limited TFP..." (from www). How much did you offer?Good shot, just cannot figure out to whom is the tribute?', '2006-01-26 22:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2090083, 285639, 30982, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed reading about the photographer - thanks for pointing him out!  I see the softness that he employed early in his career here.</td>', 'I enjoyed reading about the photographer - thanks for pointing him out!  I see the softness that he employed early in his career here.', '2006-01-26 22:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2090119, 284224, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s clear to see the inspiration when compared to Johnson''s work.  I like the addition of a person here.</td>', 'It''s clear to see the inspiration when compared to Johnson''s work.  I like the addition of a person here.', '2006-01-26 22:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2090125, 285705, 30982, '<td valign="top">The angle is interesting but it''s a bit dark.</td>', 'The angle is interesting but it''s a bit dark.', '2006-01-26 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
