(2091277, 285761, 16148, '<td valign="top">Simple image that needs exact lighting, contrast and focus to score high.  Your tones are nice but I''m seeing lots of jagged edges on the flower petals.  Maybe you over sharpened a little.</td>', 'Simple image that needs exact lighting, contrast and focus to score high.  Your tones are nice but I''m seeing lots of jagged edges on the flower petals.  Maybe you over sharpened a little.', '2006-01-27 05:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
