(2092302, 284602, 46634, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image.  The only criticism I have is the white lines on her left thigh.  It immediately caught my attention.  A slight dodge/clone of these lines would have drastically improved it.  I wish I could vote higher for this photo, but Ms. Gestro is a model, not a photographer.  &lt;edited after results....&gt;  I see she was the model.  ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-01 01:27:33.</i></td>', 'This is a lovely image.  The only criticism I have is the white lines on her left thigh.  It immediately caught my attention.  A slight dodge/clone of these lines would have drastically improved it.  I wish I could vote higher for this photo, but Ms. Gestro is a model, not a photographer.  <edited after results....>  I see she was the model.  ;-)', '2006-01-27 13:08:53.000000', '2006-02-01 01:27:33.000000', 1),
