(2092390, 283895, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice expression.  Wish for more light - know you were trying to emulate the opera images, but it''s just too dark.</td>', 'Nice expression.  Wish for more light - know you were trying to emulate the opera images, but it''s just too dark.', '2006-01-27 13:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092392, 284708, 48245, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.stern.de/unterhaltung/fotografie/544485.html?backref=%2Funterhaltung%2Ffotografie%2F544392.html&amp;nv=fs&amp;cp=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.stern.de/unterhaltung/fotografie/544485.html?backref=%2Funterhaltung%2Ffotografie%2F544392.html&amp;nv=fs&amp;cp=1</a> <br/> <br/>Good attempt. But when I look at the closeup series what I see are pictures that are warmer in tone with more contrast. Your picture seems to have a cold tone to it and could have been helped with some level adjustments to get it warmer. Also, you should have paid attention to the background... note the link and the backgrounds.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-02 22:03:12.</i></td>', '//www.stern.de/unterhaltung/fotografie/544485.html?backref=%2Funterhaltung%2Ffotografie%2F544392.html&nv=fs&cp=1  Good attempt. But when I look at the closeup series what I see are pictures that are warmer in tone with more contrast. Your picture seems to have a cold tone to it and could have been helped with some level adjustments to get it warmer. Also, you should have paid attention to the background... note the link and the backgrounds.', '2006-01-27 14:00:11.000000', '2006-02-02 22:03:12.000000', 1),
(2092398, 283986, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but image leaves me looking for a little something more, maybe because the water looks oversharpened and solid.</td>', 'Nice colors, but image leaves me looking for a little something more, maybe because the water looks oversharpened and solid.', '2006-01-27 14:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
