(2092445, 283957, 50695, '<td valign="top">I went to hulubei''s site and looked at a lot of pictures. None were so intensely close up, nor did they have the distinctive fuzzy/washed-out look of your photo.</td>', 'I went to hulubei''s site and looked at a lot of pictures. None were so intensely close up, nor did they have the distinctive fuzzy/washed-out look of your photo.', '2006-01-27 14:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092446, 285602, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely face, eyes, and expression.  Sharp/soft transition effect seems overdone, and you didn''t mention a well-know photographer for comparision.</td>', 'Lovely face, eyes, and expression.  Sharp/soft transition effect seems overdone, and you didn''t mention a well-know photographer for comparision.', '2006-01-27 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092455, 285589, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice elements.  Better lighting on baby would help a lot, as the baby seems lost in the dark.  Color choices also make the baby fade.</td>', 'Nice elements.  Better lighting on baby would help a lot, as the baby seems lost in the dark.  Color choices also make the baby fade.', '2006-01-27 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092464, 284196, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and gradients.  Overall image seems too mid-tone, brighter levels and/or a touch more contrast may help.</td>', 'Nice colors and gradients.  Overall image seems too mid-tone, brighter levels and/or a touch more contrast may help.', '2006-01-27 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092476, 284112, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice assortment of flowers and colors.  Face seems overly elongated, and border is oddly assymetrical.  Perhaps more saturation would help give the image more pop.</td>', 'Nice assortment of flowers and colors.  Face seems overly elongated, and border is oddly assymetrical.  Perhaps more saturation would help give the image more pop.', '2006-01-27 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092480, 284470, 44490, '<td valign="top">Has an interesting feel, but lighting seems to obscure too much of her, while the books are well illuminated and sharp, drawing the eye away from her.</td>', 'Has an interesting feel, but lighting seems to obscure too much of her, while the books are well illuminated and sharp, drawing the eye away from her.', '2006-01-27 14:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092486, 285597, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, nice hair and lashes.  Ear of person in background is confusing and distracting.</td>', 'Interesting angle, nice hair and lashes.  Ear of person in background is confusing and distracting.', '2006-01-27 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092492, 285254, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting tree.  Fence post is distracting, perhaps moving a foot right would be better, with a less vertical fenceline.</td>', 'Interesting tree.  Fence post is distracting, perhaps moving a foot right would be better, with a less vertical fenceline.', '2006-01-27 14:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092518, 283475, 48967, '<td valign="top">Nice tribute to warhol...</td>', 'Nice tribute to warhol...', '2006-01-27 14:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092588, 285486, 41163, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. If only the sky was a bit more dramatic.. I mean, burned. :-p 9.</td>', 'Excellent capture. If only the sky was a bit more dramatic.. I mean, burned. :-p 9.', '2006-01-27 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092617, 285638, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love weston''s images and I am an avid fan of his work. From knowing his work and seeing your interpretation of it, may I suggest that the distinction between true blacks and whites be made so as to make this image pop. As it is, the contrast seems too low. I like your take on his "Pepper" image though which is quite different from his versions. I think this is the intent of this exercise - that is to emulate someone but still leave a little of your own interpretation. Great try ;) 5</td>', 'I love weston''s images and I am an avid fan of his work. From knowing his work and seeing your interpretation of it, may I suggest that the distinction between true blacks and whites be made so as to make this image pop. As it is, the contrast seems too low. I like your take on his "Pepper" image though which is quite different from his versions. I think this is the intent of this exercise - that is to emulate someone but still leave a little of your own interpretation. Great try ;) 5', '2006-01-27 15:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092620, 285117, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think the old 40''s feel of this image is spot on! Love the overall tonal qualities and the sepia PP that you used. I think the other "elements" such as the floor and her clothes, the phone, her purse, it all completes the feel of this photo. Great job my friend.</td>', 'I think the old 40''s feel of this image is spot on! Love the overall tonal qualities and the sepia PP that you used. I think the other "elements" such as the floor and her clothes, the phone, her purse, it all completes the feel of this photo. Great job my friend.', '2006-01-27 15:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092621, 285439, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this image needs clear and sharp focusing. The colors are nice but is muted by the lack of focus.</td>', 'I think this image needs clear and sharp focusing. The colors are nice but is muted by the lack of focus.', '2006-01-27 15:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092632, 285100, 37893, '<td valign="top">Diane Arbus was defiitely known for her old time classic America images. This has the feel but needs just the slight push forward to really make it sing. I suggest cleaning up your props for one thing. The empty hangers in the background, the ties on the left hand side, etc. These all constitute and add to the feel of the photo. Another trick as well is to have your subject placed in the thirds so that there''s balance in the asymmetrical qualities of the image. Does that make sense? Good luck.</td>', 'Diane Arbus was defiitely known for her old time classic America images. This has the feel but needs just the slight push forward to really make it sing. I suggest cleaning up your props for one thing. The empty hangers in the background, the ties on the left hand side, etc. These all constitute and add to the feel of the photo. Another trick as well is to have your subject placed in the thirds so that there''s balance in the asymmetrical qualities of the image. Does that make sense? Good luck.', '2006-01-27 15:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092634, 283957, 37893, '<td valign="top">The focus seems soft, way to soft in my opinion to a point where the sharpness and glint in the eyes are lost. Maybe a tighter crop and an adjustment of levels as a suggestion, would help bring out this gem.</td>', 'The focus seems soft, way to soft in my opinion to a point where the sharpness and glint in the eyes are lost. Maybe a tighter crop and an adjustment of levels as a suggestion, would help bring out this gem.', '2006-01-27 15:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092636, 283134, 37893, '<td valign="top">This one seems out of focus and with no definite "subject".</td>', 'This one seems out of focus and with no definite "subject".', '2006-01-27 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092637, 284941, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice image study perfect as an advert. I think it''s a tad too tight at the bottom but aside from that, it''ll make for a great print for a magazine. The DOF and focus is spot on.</td>', 'Nice image study perfect as an advert. I think it''s a tad too tight at the bottom but aside from that, it''ll make for a great print for a magazine. The DOF and focus is spot on.', '2006-01-27 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092639, 284694, 37893, '<td valign="top">Sensual and intriguing. A slight bit of bruning perhaps will bring out definitions that are simply too concealed to see. Just a suggestion of course ;)</td>', 'Sensual and intriguing. A slight bit of bruning perhaps will bring out definitions that are simply too concealed to see. Just a suggestion of course ;)', '2006-01-27 15:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092641, 284618, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very nice clean and simple image. This will make for a great photo when she''s all grown up. A prized and cherished memory of your beautiful baby ;)</td>', 'Very nice clean and simple image. This will make for a great photo when she''s all grown up. A prized and cherished memory of your beautiful baby ;)', '2006-01-27 15:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092645, 284916, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting and intriguing. The tonal qualities are good overall. The black dress seems to disappear from the the background. I would have probably cloned out the poster edge just on the upper left hand corner.</td>', 'This is very interesting and intriguing. The tonal qualities are good overall. The black dress seems to disappear from the the background. I would have probably cloned out the poster edge just on the upper left hand corner.', '2006-01-27 15:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092646, 283617, 37893, '<td valign="top">Another Weston gem! Love the subject and the use of sepia tones throught. Great detail on the skull as well. Great job!</td>', 'Another Weston gem! Love the subject and the use of sepia tones throught. Great detail on the skull as well. Great job!', '2006-01-27 15:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092648, 285122, 37893, '<td valign="top">The dragan filter is not as apparent in this image but I do like the composition of this photo. There seems to be such an emotive feel to this image. Great lighting too.</td>', 'The dragan filter is not as apparent in this image but I do like the composition of this photo. There seems to be such an emotive feel to this image. Great lighting too.', '2006-01-27 15:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092651, 285196, 37893, '<td valign="top">The absolute simplicity of this image is the thing that strikes me the most. Clean and simple and jjbeguin will definitely see this as a lovely tribute to his great work and contributions to this group. Lovely duotones ;)</td>', 'The absolute simplicity of this image is the thing that strikes me the most. Clean and simple and jjbeguin will definitely see this as a lovely tribute to his great work and contributions to this group. Lovely duotones ;)', '2006-01-27 15:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092653, 284907, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Might be a tad too tight of a crop up top and bottom. (6)</td>', 'Very nice. Might be a tad too tight of a crop up top and bottom. (6)', '2006-01-27 15:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092655, 285562, 37893, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet portrait and the placement of this baby against the mother''s busom makes for the perfect setting ;) Such expressive eyes at such a young age. The skin is so pure and almost porcelain like. It''s amazing looking at babies eyes because the whites in their young eyes are actually not white but with a tint of blue ;) Such innocence. Great job!</td>', 'Such a sweet portrait and the placement of this baby against the mother''s busom makes for the perfect setting ;) Such expressive eyes at such a young age. The skin is so pure and almost porcelain like. It''s amazing looking at babies eyes because the whites in their young eyes are actually not white but with a tint of blue ;) Such innocence. Great job!', '2006-01-27 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092657, 285694, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice BW image. The focus might be a tad soft to represent Newton''s work but I like the adrogynous feel of this image. The noise actually adds to the feel of this image ;)</td>', 'Nice BW image. The focus might be a tad soft to represent Newton''s work but I like the adrogynous feel of this image. The noise actually adds to the feel of this image ;)', '2006-01-27 15:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092659, 285747, 37893, '<td valign="top">The glint in his eye is just mesmerizing. It''s almost haunting. I love the blur in the background. I would love to see this man and see for myself the years of experience written all over his face. Langley would be proud.</td>', 'The glint in his eye is just mesmerizing. It''s almost haunting. I love the blur in the background. I would love to see this man and see for myself the years of experience written all over his face. Langley would be proud.', '2006-01-27 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2092663, 283734, 48245, '<td valign="top">[quote]he elevated many of his images into an iconic status that perfectly captured the melding of everyday existence in urban and rural Mexico...[/quote]<br/> <br/>His works tend to focus on people and life. Not sure this captures that for me. I couldn''t find any examples of his works that where landscape based.</td>', '[quote]he elevated many of his images into an iconic status that perfectly captured the melding of everyday existence in urban and rural Mexico...[/quote] His works tend to focus on people and life. Not sure this captures that for me. I couldn''t find any examples of his works that where landscape based.', '2006-01-27 15:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
