(2093305, 285354, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely done in her style.  Where''d you find such a tiny new one?  :-)</td>', 'Nicely done in her style.  Where''d you find such a tiny new one?  :-)', '2006-01-27 20:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093308, 284690, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of tonal qualities throughout. The flower on the right is a bit bright compared to the rest but it''s ok. It''s not ditracting from the whole photo. Great textures as well. Good job!</td>', 'Great composition and use of tonal qualities throughout. The flower on the right is a bit bright compared to the rest but it''s ok. It''s not ditracting from the whole photo. Great textures as well. Good job!', '2006-01-27 20:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093313, 284600, 37893, '<td valign="top">I like this image but for some reason, I seem to want to see this right side up. The BW is great and a good call back to Mewton''s erotica images. One last thing is to make sure you''re maximizing the size of you image. This seems a tad small.</td>', 'I like this image but for some reason, I seem to want to see this right side up. The BW is great and a good call back to Mewton''s erotica images. One last thing is to make sure you''re maximizing the size of you image. This seems a tad small.', '2006-01-27 20:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093314, 284602, 30982, '<td valign="top">Those are some strange-lookin'' boots!  But the image is representative of the referenced artist''s style and the picture is well done.  Maybe edit the reflection of the sequins on her thigh, though.</td>', 'Those are some strange-lookin'' boots!  But the image is representative of the referenced artist''s style and the picture is well done.  Maybe edit the reflection of the sequins on her thigh, though.', '2006-01-27 20:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093317, 285594, 30982, '<td valign="top">You captured "the look" that Schoeller seems to get, but need better light to reflect the eyes.</td>', 'You captured "the look" that Schoeller seems to get, but need better light to reflect the eyes.', '2006-01-27 20:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093327, 284871, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait - like the positioning in the frame and the softness and even lighting.</td>', 'Very nice portrait - like the positioning in the frame and the softness and even lighting.', '2006-01-27 20:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093331, 284969, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice tribute. Shades of black and whites are evident as in his photos. The logo of the ski could go though in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice tribute. Shades of black and whites are evident as in his photos. The logo of the ski could go though in my opinion.', '2006-01-27 20:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093339, 284570, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this leaf. Good job in making sure that it didn''t hit the corners ;) The lovely folds and the overall shades of greay and blacks and whites make this a beautiful piece of art.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this leaf. Good job in making sure that it didn''t hit the corners ;) The lovely folds and the overall shades of greay and blacks and whites make this a beautiful piece of art.', '2006-01-27 20:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093341, 285081, 30982, '<td valign="top">Leigh-Logan appears to be a very versatile commercial photographer; from what I saw, she focused on kids, dogs, and flowers.  This is an interesting image on it''s own, though.  Nice clarity.</td>', 'Leigh-Logan appears to be a very versatile commercial photographer; from what I saw, she focused on kids, dogs, and flowers.  This is an interesting image on it''s own, though.  Nice clarity.', '2006-01-27 20:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093346, 285656, 37893, '<td valign="top">I was almost certain Mapplethorpe does mostly BW. However, your interpretation of his work is superb. My suggestion is to probably have 3 lillies instead of two. Asymetrical compositions seem to work better in my opinion. The light source and patterns caused by your lighting is nice and soft and gentle. Good job.</td>', 'I was almost certain Mapplethorpe does mostly BW. However, your interpretation of his work is superb. My suggestion is to probably have 3 lillies instead of two. Asymetrical compositions seem to work better in my opinion. The light source and patterns caused by your lighting is nice and soft and gentle. Good job.', '2006-01-27 20:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093352, 284196, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice balance of contrast, colors and symmetry. The delicate balance on glass marbles are superb as well as the use of the mirror to further accentuate the shapes and lines of this beautiful piece. Great job my friend.</td>', 'Nice balance of contrast, colors and symmetry. The delicate balance on glass marbles are superb as well as the use of the mirror to further accentuate the shapes and lines of this beautiful piece. Great job my friend.', '2006-01-27 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093356, 285094, 30982, '<td valign="top">Captured the nice soft focus of Stieglitz well.  Balanced composition.</td>', 'Captured the nice soft focus of Stieglitz well.  Balanced composition.', '2006-01-27 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093360, 285694, 41914, '<td valign="top">I''ve recently discovered the brilliance of Newton. This image is awesome. I beleive it will be one of the winners 8</td>', 'I''ve recently discovered the brilliance of Newton. This image is awesome. I beleive it will be one of the winners 8', '2006-01-27 20:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093363, 284118, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for a long narrow composition such as Lik''s.</td>', 'Nice subject for a long narrow composition such as Lik''s.', '2006-01-27 20:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093366, 284540, 30982, '<td valign="top">Warhol, yes?  :-)</td>', 'Warhol, yes?  :-)', '2006-01-27 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093368, 284988, 41914, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge a sure ribbon 9</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge a sure ribbon 9', '2006-01-27 20:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093370, 285451, 37893, '<td valign="top">Abstract photos unfortunately haven''t been widely accepted here on DPC. This image will unfortunately be one of them. In as much as abstraction is capable of having beauty in itself, most folks don''t really lean towards it much. I know as I''ve submitted a few abstracts. The border is quite distracting as it affects the mood created by the subtle ripples and the blue colors. Good luck and i hope this does well.</td>', 'Abstract photos unfortunately haven''t been widely accepted here on DPC. This image will unfortunately be one of them. In as much as abstraction is capable of having beauty in itself, most folks don''t really lean towards it much. I know as I''ve submitted a few abstracts. The border is quite distracting as it affects the mood created by the subtle ripples and the blue colors. Good luck and i hope this does well.', '2006-01-27 20:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093374, 285747, 30982, '<td valign="top">The tones are quite representative Lange''s work, as is the haunting look you''ve captured.  Nice job of isolating the subject from the background as well.</td>', 'The tones are quite representative Lange''s work, as is the haunting look you''ve captured.  Nice job of isolating the subject from the background as well.', '2006-01-27 20:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093376, 285485, 37893, '<td valign="top">Oh this has a lot of potential in it. I can almost see the "diamond in the rough" in this image. I personally would have burned the clouds to bring out the "fluffyness" and texture, The mountain seems dark even on my bright screen. Great try ;)</td>', 'Oh this has a lot of potential in it. I can almost see the "diamond in the rough" in this image. I personally would have burned the clouds to bring out the "fluffyness" and texture, The mountain seems dark even on my bright screen. Great try ;)', '2006-01-27 20:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093378, 284864, 37893, '<td valign="top">This will be one of those images that might potentially score low due to the complete lack of focus.</td>', 'This will be one of those images that might potentially score low due to the complete lack of focus.', '2006-01-27 20:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093382, 284871, 37893, '<td valign="top">I like the look in your father''s eyes. I think for this portrait to be even more effective, you could crop it tighter, less shoulder and just smack to his face. The black background is great and I like the use of BW in this image. I''m sure your father will be pleased with the results of your efforts. Great job!</td>', 'I like the look in your father''s eyes. I think for this portrait to be even more effective, you could crop it tighter, less shoulder and just smack to his face. The black background is great and I like the use of BW in this image. I''m sure your father will be pleased with the results of your efforts. Great job!', '2006-01-27 20:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093387, 284447, 37893, '<td valign="top">ZThe use of high contrast is great for this image. It''s very "advert-like". It might be too two toned for most but I like this image for some reason. Great efforts my friend.</td>', 'ZThe use of high contrast is great for this image. It''s very "advert-like". It might be too two toned for most but I like this image for some reason. Great efforts my friend.', '2006-01-27 20:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093389, 283962, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this would be great BW. Completely desaturated. The onject you used is incredible and I''ve been trying to look for one. These shells show lots of character and texture and makes for incredible images. Might I suggest shooting tighter and at an angle. I''m sure there are infinite possibilities to shoot this beautiful product of Mother Nature. Great shot!</td>', 'I think this would be great BW. Completely desaturated. The onject you used is incredible and I''ve been trying to look for one. These shells show lots of character and texture and makes for incredible images. Might I suggest shooting tighter and at an angle. I''m sure there are infinite possibilities to shoot this beautiful product of Mother Nature. Great shot!', '2006-01-27 20:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093391, 285749, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this image, if it is in fact tributed to a photographer, could be a lot better had it been shot in portrait mode as opposed to landscape.  However, I believe that this one will score poorly due to the lack of subject and interest.</td>', 'I think this image, if it is in fact tributed to a photographer, could be a lot better had it been shot in portrait mode as opposed to landscape.  However, I believe that this one will score poorly due to the lack of subject and interest.', '2006-01-27 20:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093397, 285486, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great use of tonalities throughout the image. I believe I have seen that strucure before but I just can''t place it. I am sure it was in a prior challenge but from a different angle. I would suggest burning the clouds to make it even "angrier". Ansel Adams was know for big, hunky, angry clouds. Great job!</td>', 'Great use of tonalities throughout the image. I believe I have seen that strucure before but I just can''t place it. I am sure it was in a prior challenge but from a different angle. I would suggest burning the clouds to make it even "angrier". Ansel Adams was know for big, hunky, angry clouds. Great job!', '2006-01-27 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093398, 285008, 37893, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice and peaceful image and your viewer would probably wonder what she''s thinking of the exact moment you shot this image. The horizon is a bit tilted but no biggie. The tones are great and so is the use of BW.</td>', 'This is such a nice and peaceful image and your viewer would probably wonder what she''s thinking of the exact moment you shot this image. The horizon is a bit tilted but no biggie. The tones are great and so is the use of BW.', '2006-01-27 20:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093400, 284886, 37893, '<td valign="top">Wow! beautiful cloud formations! The sunset shot is absolutely beautiful and the touch of green completely adds a different texture to the image.</td>', 'Wow! beautiful cloud formations! The sunset shot is absolutely beautiful and the touch of green completely adds a different texture to the image.', '2006-01-27 20:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093401, 285283, 30982, '<td valign="top">Though much of his work featured people, this does seem true to his style of "complex compositions through which the viewer weaves".</td>', 'Though much of his work featured people, this does seem true to his style of "complex compositions through which the viewer weaves".', '2006-01-27 20:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093403, 285345, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good transposition to today!  A bit more focus on the subject, though.</td>', 'Good transposition to today!  A bit more focus on the subject, though.', '2006-01-27 20:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2093406, 285656, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the curve of light - very nice!  The vase seems to be a bit overpowering.</td>', 'Love the curve of light - very nice!  The vase seems to be a bit overpowering.', '2006-01-27 20:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
