(2097331, 285759, 37893, '<td valign="top">Almost abstract form of photography here. Almost creepy but I like it. 6</td>', 'Almost abstract form of photography here. Almost creepy but I like it. 6', '2006-01-29 03:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097333, 285411, 37893, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV. The floor is a bit blown out. Not quite sure who this is being "tributed" to but unfortunately, it doesn''t hold my attention span for too long. This might be downplayed in the challenege for simply being too "snap shottish". Sorry just my honest opinion.</td>', 'Interesting POV. The floor is a bit blown out. Not quite sure who this is being "tributed" to but unfortunately, it doesn''t hold my attention span for too long. This might be downplayed in the challenege for simply being too "snap shottish". Sorry just my honest opinion.', '2006-01-29 03:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097338, 285308, 37893, '<td valign="top">This image needs focus. Except for her right strap, nothing seems to be in focus. Sorry.</td>', 'This image needs focus. Except for her right strap, nothing seems to be in focus. Sorry.', '2006-01-29 03:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097342, 285594, 37893, '<td valign="top">Schoeller''s portraits are tightly cropped even though expressions are stark and empty. I think for this image to be as powerful, first, sharp focus needs to be present. It''s lacking in that area. A tighter crop would be good as well. Lastly, Schoeller''s eyes are very sharp. I think this needs it as well. Great try though/</td>', 'Schoeller''s portraits are tightly cropped even though expressions are stark and empty. I think for this image to be as powerful, first, sharp focus needs to be present. It''s lacking in that area. A tighter crop would be good as well. Lastly, Schoeller''s eyes are very sharp. I think this needs it as well. Great try though/', '2006-01-29 03:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097344, 283468, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait that holds me attention span and makes me come back for more reviews. Bumping up! 7</td>', 'Nice portrait that holds me attention span and makes me come back for more reviews. Bumping up! 7', '2006-01-29 03:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097348, 285599, 37893, '<td valign="top">I think this would be highly effective if the sunset colors were reflected in the puddle. The textures are there... it''s just the colors that needs to be played out.</td>', 'I think this would be highly effective if the sunset colors were reflected in the puddle. The textures are there... it''s just the colors that needs to be played out.', '2006-01-29 03:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097350, 283829, 37893, '<td valign="top">This image is small to start off. There''s a sense of curiousity here and if the subject were placed in the right with using ROTs, I think this would be fantastic ;)</td>', 'This image is small to start off. There''s a sense of curiousity here and if the subject were placed in the right with using ROTs, I think this would be fantastic ;)', '2006-01-29 03:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097351, 285753, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot, wish you had included the "tribute to" hope you don''t get hammered for that...</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot, wish you had included the "tribute to" hope you don''t get hammered for that...', '2006-01-29 03:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097353, 285733, 37893, '<td valign="top">Not much really happening here. I think this suffers from too much mountain and not enough definitive subject. The fog, while great in some respects, is a bit distracting to a point. Plus you spelled his name wrong ;)</td>', 'Not much really happening here. I think this suffers from too much mountain and not enough definitive subject. The fog, while great in some respects, is a bit distracting to a point. Plus you spelled his name wrong ;)', '2006-01-29 03:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097357, 285657, 37893, '<td valign="top">This image seems to be too centrally composed. I would suggest placing the subject in the thirds using ROTs. The two stems or leaves on the left could be taken out as they don''t really add anything to the overall composition of the image.</td>', 'This image seems to be too centrally composed. I would suggest placing the subject in the thirds using ROTs. The two stems or leaves on the left could be taken out as they don''t really add anything to the overall composition of the image.', '2006-01-29 03:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097358, 285418, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great shot and use of a semi-long exposure to get the wispy flavor of the river. Great job my friend.</td>', 'Great shot and use of a semi-long exposure to get the wispy flavor of the river. Great job my friend.', '2006-01-29 03:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097361, 285313, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice saturation of shades and shadows. However, I think this is one of those images that will suffer from votes of being too "snap-shottish" as your title mentions.</td>', 'Nice saturation of shades and shadows. However, I think this is one of those images that will suffer from votes of being too "snap-shottish" as your title mentions.', '2006-01-29 03:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097362, 285094, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great POV and use of desaturation here. The bridge is a bit dark underneath but that seems to be ok. Burn the clouds and bring out the shadows. I think this bridge will sing majestically ;)</td>', 'Great POV and use of desaturation here. The bridge is a bit dark underneath but that seems to be ok. Burn the clouds and bring out the shadows. I think this bridge will sing majestically ;)', '2006-01-29 03:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097364, 285453, 37893, '<td valign="top">Simple and stark. I''m curious as to how your subject looks and that may very well be why I think this image triggers my curiosity and questions. Great take on this challenge.</td>', 'Simple and stark. I''m curious as to how your subject looks and that may very well be why I think this image triggers my curiosity and questions. Great take on this challenge.', '2006-01-29 03:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097372, 285605, 37893, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery. This will be marked high by most I hope. Just absolutely pleasing to look at. Great job my friend.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery. This will be marked high by most I hope. Just absolutely pleasing to look at. Great job my friend.', '2006-01-29 03:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097375, 285735, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love the message this image conveys. The reflections and the duotones sets the mood for this lovely and successful rendition. Great job!</td>', 'I love the message this image conveys. The reflections and the duotones sets the mood for this lovely and successful rendition. Great job!', '2006-01-29 03:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097379, 283382, 37893, '<td valign="top">Very nice and somber image. The lonely flower is quite dramatic with it''s single light source and stooping feature ;) Great job of using BW too!</td>', 'Very nice and somber image. The lonely flower is quite dramatic with it''s single light source and stooping feature ;) Great job of using BW too!', '2006-01-29 03:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097380, 284470, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love the mysterious feel of this image straight of out a Hitchcock movie set it seems. The BW and the frame really completes the success of this image. A bit dark at the lower left corner but I don''t seem to mind.</td>', 'I love the mysterious feel of this image straight of out a Hitchcock movie set it seems. The BW and the frame really completes the success of this image. A bit dark at the lower left corner but I don''t seem to mind.', '2006-01-29 03:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2097381, 285434, 37893, '<td valign="top">I love the transparency this image portrays. The canvas and the branches all combine to create one lovely image. Great job! The duotones make it quite poignant as well. Great eye for composition.</td>', 'I love the transparency this image portrays. The canvas and the branches all combine to create one lovely image. Great job! The duotones make it quite poignant as well. Great eye for composition.', '2006-01-29 03:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
