(2098230, 285575, 47030, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...  Did you add the grain to the face in the Post Processing?  Great job... Adding this to my favorites...</td>', 'Beautiful...  Did you add the grain to the face in the Post Processing?  Great job... Adding this to my favorites...', '2006-01-29 12:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098245, 285705, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts here but it seems just slightly too dark even in my bright monitor.</td>', 'Nice contrasts here but it seems just slightly too dark even in my bright monitor.', '2006-01-29 12:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098246, 285544, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition. Maybe a person or something could have been at the top of the stairs to complete the leading line effect. As it is, my eye just seems to just wander off the page.</td>', 'Nice rendition. Maybe a person or something could have been at the top of the stairs to complete the leading line effect. As it is, my eye just seems to just wander off the page.', '2006-01-29 12:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098248, 285325, 37893, '<td valign="top">A greater DOF would have made this image stronger. I think an adjustment in colors is called for this image. As it is right now, there is nothing that holds my attention and pay particular interest to this image. Sounds harsh but I believe it''s the reality of this photo. Sorry but no harm intended here. Just improvement :)</td>', 'A greater DOF would have made this image stronger. I think an adjustment in colors is called for this image. As it is right now, there is nothing that holds my attention and pay particular interest to this image. Sounds harsh but I believe it''s the reality of this photo. Sorry but no harm intended here. Just improvement :)', '2006-01-29 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098680, 285354, 32133, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  The lighting so so soft and warm.  My favorite so far. 10</td>', 'Lovely shot.  The lighting so so soft and warm.  My favorite so far. 10', '2006-01-29 15:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098713, 285287, 32133, '<td valign="top">The zipper not laying flat is distracting.  I also think it would look better if the stem of the glass lined up with the zipper.  Concept is good.  Lighting and quality really nice.</td>', 'The zipper not laying flat is distracting.  I also think it would look better if the stem of the glass lined up with the zipper.  Concept is good.  Lighting and quality really nice.', '2006-01-29 15:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098715, 283627, 37893, '<td valign="top">Now this is the Dragan effect that he is very well known for. Congartulations on effectively being inspired by Andrzej. In my faves.<br/> <br/>Edit to add: I believe is Leslie''s image! Great job Les!</td>', 'Now this is the Dragan effect that he is very well known for. Congartulations on effectively being inspired by Andrzej. In my faves. Edit to add: I believe is Leslie''s image! Great job Les!', '2006-01-29 15:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098722, 285632, 37893, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or this image is blurry? I think had the background been black and with one light source, i think this would have been powerful. Peter Witkin is also know for burning the edges of his image. Maybe that''s worth a shot as well ;)</td>', 'Is it just me or this image is blurry? I think had the background been black and with one light source, i think this would have been powerful. Peter Witkin is also know for burning the edges of his image. Maybe that''s worth a shot as well ;)', '2006-01-29 15:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098731, 283159, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is incredibly lovely; the tones and composition are just about perfect!</td>', 'this is incredibly lovely; the tones and composition are just about perfect!', '2006-01-29 15:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098732, 285486, 32754, '<td valign="top">Well done, love the foreground to background view.</td>', 'Well done, love the foreground to background view.', '2006-01-29 15:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098738, 285640, 32754, '<td valign="top">good work on this striking image! back for another look; it almost has a tactile feeling in the skin texture..I love it!</td>', 'good work on this striking image! back for another look; it almost has a tactile feeling in the skin texture..I love it!', '2006-01-29 15:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2098740, 284988, 32754, '<td valign="top">Very lovely tribute image..the tones and softness, the composition, very well done.</td>', 'Very lovely tribute image..the tones and softness, the composition, very well done.', '2006-01-29 15:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
