(2098796, 285524, 43519, '<td valign="top">That is very minimalist. I like a lot the style, great contrast, maybe the grass (or the field?) should have been a little bit sharper. 9</td>', 'That is very minimalist. I like a lot the style, great contrast, maybe the grass (or the field?) should have been a little bit sharper. 9', '2006-01-29 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
