(2098819, 284643, 43519, '<td valign="top">I was so disappointed to look for real good pictures for this particular challenge (and there are not many to my tastes), and finally one that makes me feel that photography can be both simple and efficient. Hope this one will reach the top positions. The contrast is well set. Perfect - 10</td>', 'I was so disappointed to look for real good pictures for this particular challenge (and there are not many to my tastes), and finally one that makes me feel that photography can be both simple and efficient. Hope this one will reach the top positions. The contrast is well set. Perfect - 10', '2006-01-29 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
