(2099082, 285317, 40019, '<td valign="top">Thanks for pointing me to one of the pioneers of photography - great choice! Nice emulation of his work as well.  I would have like to have seen a little more vignetting that what appears to be burning (correct me if I am wrong). Nice B/W conversion - great textures and depth. [FYI, if you shoot in RAW, you could use PS RAW to add the vignetting effect.]</td>', 'Thanks for pointing me to one of the pioneers of photography - great choice! Nice emulation of his work as well.  I would have like to have seen a little more vignetting that what appears to be burning (correct me if I am wrong). Nice B/W conversion - great textures and depth. [FYI, if you shoot in RAW, you could use PS RAW to add the vignetting effect.]', '2006-01-29 18:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099089, 285524, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nicely done.  This could be one of his works, as far as I am concerned.</td>', 'Wow, very nicely done.  This could be one of his works, as far as I am concerned.', '2006-01-29 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
