(2099787, 285747, 50695, '<td valign="top">the eyes don''t seem that haunting to me. also, dorothea always seemed to have some background with the figure. the blurred out background and floating 3-d foregrounded subject with shiny highlights, including zipper, seems undorothea to me. But nice photo.</td>', 'the eyes don''t seem that haunting to me. also, dorothea always seemed to have some background with the figure. the blurred out background and floating 3-d foregrounded subject with shiny highlights, including zipper, seems undorothea to me. But nice photo.', '2006-01-29 22:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2099803, 285593, 50695, '<td valign="top">I assume a tribute to Doisneau. I don''t sense a story the way I do from Doisneau, but it''s still a good photo. Exciting composition. The subject is the photographer as much as it is anyone else.</td>', 'I assume a tribute to Doisneau. I don''t sense a story the way I do from Doisneau, but it''s still a good photo. Exciting composition. The subject is the photographer as much as it is anyone else.', '2006-01-29 22:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
