(2102621, 285554, 37893, '<td valign="top">Her eyes are truly engaging. The almost black areas aroundher head works well in this shot. I love the little curled lip as well. Truly a mesmerizing look! 7 great job!</td>', 'Her eyes are truly engaging. The almost black areas aroundher head works well in this shot. I love the little curled lip as well. Truly a mesmerizing look! 7 great job!', '2006-01-30 15:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102623, 283475, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very Pop-Art and wonderfully colorful.</td>', 'Very Pop-Art and wonderfully colorful.', '2006-01-30 15:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102626, 284739, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent poet-processing work here. I love the muted colors and the dark contrast.</td>', 'Excellent poet-processing work here. I love the muted colors and the dark contrast.', '2006-01-30 15:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102628, 283320, 37893, '<td valign="top">I thought someone would do Robert. Robert is know for flowers, his fish net and abstract architecture. However, this is your take on the subject and the photographer so I will comment based on this image. I think the black background suits well in this image. The pot is a bit distracting but the sharpness in the cacti is excellent.</td>', 'I thought someone would do Robert. Robert is know for flowers, his fish net and abstract architecture. However, this is your take on the subject and the photographer so I will comment based on this image. I think the black background suits well in this image. The pot is a bit distracting but the sharpness in the cacti is excellent.', '2006-01-30 15:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102629, 285544, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great composition with lots of contrast. Love the details in the trees.</td>', 'Great composition with lots of contrast. Love the details in the trees.', '2006-01-30 15:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102635, 285022, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition that holds my attention well. The almost abstract way of composing this image is good. I think this will finish in the middle of the pack though as some might view this as a ho-hum image. For me however, the layering and textures that the different materials create is excellent. 6</td>', 'Nice simple composition that holds my attention well. The almost abstract way of composing this image is good. I think this will finish in the middle of the pack though as some might view this as a ho-hum image. For me however, the layering and textures that the different materials create is excellent. 6', '2006-01-30 15:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102639, 284990, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I would suggest locating the tree in the thirds using ROTs. If it were located to the right with the sun still showing, I think this would have been even better. Love the tilt in the horizon though and the colors are breath taking ;)</td>', 'Nice image. I would suggest locating the tree in the thirds using ROTs. If it were located to the right with the sun still showing, I think this would have been even better. Love the tilt in the horizon though and the colors are breath taking ;)', '2006-01-30 15:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102643, 285354, 37893, '<td valign="top">Such a poignant image! I love the simplicity and tenderness that this image shows. I am sure this would make a great keepsake for years to come.</td>', 'Such a poignant image! I love the simplicity and tenderness that this image shows. I am sure this would make a great keepsake for years to come.', '2006-01-30 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102646, 284171, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great color and use of lighting in this image. The sparkle really adds that extra ooomph in this image.</td>', 'Great color and use of lighting in this image. The sparkle really adds that extra ooomph in this image.', '2006-01-30 15:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102652, 285575, 37893, '<td valign="top">Love the tonal qualities here. The almost "huh" look in the face is great. I like how the shadows really definie the facial features of this model. Great job. 6</td>', 'Love the tonal qualities here. The almost "huh" look in the face is great. I like how the shadows really definie the facial features of this model. Great job. 6', '2006-01-30 15:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102657, 285640, 37893, '<td valign="top">Probably the best of all the Weston takes! Gotta love the look of this pepper and the shadows and background really makes this image a true tribute to Weston! He would be proud ;) Great image. 7</td>', 'Probably the best of all the Weston takes! Gotta love the look of this pepper and the shadows and background really makes this image a true tribute to Weston! He would be proud ;) Great image. 7', '2006-01-30 15:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102659, 285756, 37893, '<td valign="top">Good use of duotones in this image. There is enough contrast in it that it makes everything stand out. Love the lights in the buildings and they really make this image pop!</td>', 'Good use of duotones in this image. There is enough contrast in it that it makes everything stand out. Love the lights in the buildings and they really make this image pop!', '2006-01-30 15:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102687, 285738, 46232, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Better than Joey :P</td>', 'Sweet! Better than Joey :P', '2006-01-30 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102689, 285312, 46232, '<td valign="top">Wow! Just stunning display of Mother Nature ;)</td>', 'Wow! Just stunning display of Mother Nature ;)', '2006-01-30 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102690, 285660, 46232, '<td valign="top">Love this image and a true tribute ;) One of the best ones this challenge.</td>', 'Love this image and a true tribute ;) One of the best ones this challenge.', '2006-01-30 16:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102693, 283627, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great expression, range of colors and textures all contribute to a great look and feel.  Love it.</td>', 'Great expression, range of colors and textures all contribute to a great look and feel.  Love it.', '2006-01-30 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102698, 285312, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and gradients, marble-like patterns on the shore, hard and soft textures.  Just lovely.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and gradients, marble-like patterns on the shore, hard and soft textures.  Just lovely.', '2006-01-30 16:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102733, 285750, 41093, '<td valign="top">Very Interesting concept...  Nice effect</td>', 'Very Interesting concept...  Nice effect', '2006-01-30 16:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102737, 284589, 41093, '<td valign="top">Makes people go back!  Good shot</td>', 'Makes people go back!  Good shot', '2006-01-30 16:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102741, 283710, 41093, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2006-01-30 16:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102743, 284196, 14620, '<td valign="top">I''d say this is pretty much perfect!  From the colors to the lighting and the subject matter.  Spot on! 10</td>', 'I''d say this is pretty much perfect!  From the colors to the lighting and the subject matter.  Spot on! 10', '2006-01-30 16:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102744, 285117, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great photo, complete package with vintage phone, outfit, hat, handbag, gloves, and most of all, expression - my favorite for this challenge.  Background duplicated in mirror is a little distracting, but the main subject elements carry the image.  Love it.</td>', 'Great photo, complete package with vintage phone, outfit, hat, handbag, gloves, and most of all, expression - my favorite for this challenge.  Background duplicated in mirror is a little distracting, but the main subject elements carry the image.  Love it.', '2006-01-30 16:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102748, 284171, 41093, '<td valign="top">Wow Looks like magazine.</td>', 'Wow Looks like magazine.', '2006-01-30 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102757, 283710, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea, good color, exposure, and execution.  Chess players would say that the position looks contrived, but the ghost-like reflections fit right in with the fading king.  Nice.</td>', 'Great idea, good color, exposure, and execution.  Chess players would say that the position looks contrived, but the ghost-like reflections fit right in with the fading king.  Nice.', '2006-01-30 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2102770, 284418, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely study of constrast in color, texture, and durability - soft/hard, has an elegant feel like ikebana.</td>', 'Lovely study of constrast in color, texture, and durability - soft/hard, has an elegant feel like ikebana.', '2006-01-30 16:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102779, 285735, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wonderful layering of images, people, expressions - complex and emotive, can guess that getting the lighting/angle conditions was a challenge.  Wonderful.</td>', 'Wonderful layering of images, people, expressions - complex and emotive, can guess that getting the lighting/angle conditions was a challenge.  Wonderful.', '2006-01-30 16:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102790, 284567, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting expression, angle, texture, proportions of hand to face with wide-angle lens.  Background in upper right is a little distracting, but the image is so strong, it is not really an issue.  Fascinating.</td>', 'Interesting expression, angle, texture, proportions of hand to face with wide-angle lens.  Background in upper right is a little distracting, but the image is so strong, it is not really an issue.  Fascinating.', '2006-01-30 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102794, 284171, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, sharpness, DOF, reflection, star highlight.  Might wish for a different background color, obvious primaries might be better.</td>', 'Lovely image, sharpness, DOF, reflection, star highlight.  Might wish for a different background color, obvious primaries might be better.', '2006-01-30 16:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102798, 284643, 6349, '<td valign="top">Yes. 10 and favorite.</td>', 'Yes. 10 and favorite.', '2006-01-30 16:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102800, 283966, 6349, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge.  Amazing piece of art.  10 and favorite.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge.  Amazing piece of art.  10 and favorite.', '2006-01-30 16:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102801, 285519, 6349, '<td valign="top">Outstanding work. 10 and favorite.</td>', 'Outstanding work. 10 and favorite.', '2006-01-30 16:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102806, 285747, 44490, '<td valign="top">Powerful image has emotional impact, sharp eyes, beard, zipper, wrinkles contrasting with soft hooded shirt and blurred background.  Wonderful.</td>', 'Powerful image has emotional impact, sharp eyes, beard, zipper, wrinkles contrasting with soft hooded shirt and blurred background.  Wonderful.', '2006-01-30 16:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102813, 283320, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely cactus and bowl patterns and colors.  Just a little more cactus and bowl and a little less negative space would be better.  I like the image a lot.</td>', 'Lovely cactus and bowl patterns and colors.  Just a little more cactus and bowl and a little less negative space would be better.  I like the image a lot.', '2006-01-30 16:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102816, 284643, 44490, '<td valign="top">Fascinating fence, interesting shadows and lines, nice feel of couple strolling hand-in-hand.  Wonderful.</td>', 'Fascinating fence, interesting shadows and lines, nice feel of couple strolling hand-in-hand.  Wonderful.', '2006-01-30 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102820, 283475, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and shapes of heels, better than most of Warhol''s works.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and shapes of heels, better than most of Warhol''s works.', '2006-01-30 16:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102823, 285675, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mountains and feel of footprints leading toward them over the expanse of snow.  Lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful mountains and feel of footprints leading toward them over the expanse of snow.  Lovely.', '2006-01-30 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102832, 285718, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The image of the hands is barely perceptible, but I appreciate the concept, effort, and image of the landscape and reflection.  Still nice.</td>', 'Good idea.  The image of the hands is barely perceptible, but I appreciate the concept, effort, and image of the landscape and reflection.  Still nice.', '2006-01-30 16:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102841, 284969, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, elements including background, depth, exposure.  Subject is maybe too-dead center, but it still works, probably due to the continuation with the arm and ski.</td>', 'Nice composition, elements including background, depth, exposure.  Subject is maybe too-dead center, but it still works, probably due to the continuation with the arm and ski.', '2006-01-30 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102851, 283962, 9668, '<td valign="top">Aye, the nautilus, beautiful shot!</td>', 'Aye, the nautilus, beautiful shot!', '2006-01-30 17:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102860, 285706, 9668, '<td valign="top">Edward <b>Weston</b>? The lighting looks a little flat in this image, good shot though.</td>', 'Edward Weston? The lighting looks a little flat in this image, good shot though.', '2006-01-30 17:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102871, 284159, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, like the dramatic tones.</td>', 'Lovely image, like the dramatic tones.', '2006-01-30 17:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2102943, 283627, 36988, '<td valign="top">Without a doubt, best in challenge... congrats on capturing a very powerful and beautiful imge... :)</td>', 'Without a doubt, best in challenge... congrats on capturing a very powerful and beautiful imge... :)', '2006-01-30 17:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
