(2103088, 284894, 33732, '<td valign="top">Similar but not with the contrast and detail.  I like the colors.  Giving up the forground to get the richness and light colors is great.</td>', 'Similar but not with the contrast and detail.  I like the colors.  Giving up the forground to get the richness and light colors is great.', '2006-01-30 17:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
