(2103643, 285312, 51987, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors!</td>', 'Lovely colors!', '2006-01-30 20:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103650, 284988, 18219, '<td valign="top">great sepia/duo tone-works great for this image.<br/>i would have like to have seen more of the person underneath, but maybe that was your intent?<br/>and maybe perhaps a bigger image?<br/>actually, maybe there isn''t a person underneath?<br/>maybe he has just suffered a horrific motorcycle accident and his his arms are mangled like that?<br/>maybe it isn''t even a he?<br/>whatever, it''s a good image and i''m sure it will do well.</td>', 'great sepia/duo tone-works great for this image.i would have like to have seen more of the person underneath, but maybe that was your intent?and maybe perhaps a bigger image?actually, maybe there isn''t a person underneath?maybe he has just suffered a horrific motorcycle accident and his his arms are mangled like that?maybe it isn''t even a he?whatever, it''s a good image and i''m sure it will do well.', '2006-01-30 21:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103670, 285519, 18219, '<td valign="top">I don''t know who the tribute is to, but I trust you!<br/>I really like the whole scene, but I think I would prefer a little more contrast in the black and whites.<br/>there just seems to be too much "grey" in it.<br/>but then again maybe that''s what the tribute person does?<br/>I''ll never know!!!!!</td>', 'I don''t know who the tribute is to, but I trust you!I really like the whole scene, but I think I would prefer a little more contrast in the black and whites.there just seems to be too much "grey" in it.but then again maybe that''s what the tribute person does?I''ll never know!!!!!', '2006-01-30 21:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103671, 285640, 18219, '<td valign="top">kind of looks like a melted hershey kiss and a deformed human ear all in one.<br/>yet I still like it and it is amongst my top votes for this challenge.<br/>sorry I couldn''t give any constructive help with my comment.</td>', 'kind of looks like a melted hershey kiss and a deformed human ear all in one.yet I still like it and it is amongst my top votes for this challenge.sorry I couldn''t give any constructive help with my comment.', '2006-01-30 21:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103679, 284470, 18219, '<td valign="top">I like the anonimity(?) of the cut off head.<br/>I even like the too dark shadows by her legs and the blown out whites of the books.<br/>strange that.<br/>good work and good luck.</td>', 'I like the anonimity(?) of the cut off head.I even like the too dark shadows by her legs and the blown out whites of the books.strange that.good work and good luck.', '2006-01-30 21:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103693, 283475, 18219, '<td valign="top">I like the pop art of Andy Warhol.<br/>this is a nice tribute to that.<br/>a small nit pick (does that phrase refer to head lice?) would be to remove the stickers from inside the shoes.<br/>there are only two and it didn''t detract from the score I gave you (7), but i just think it would make it look better overall.<br/>oh, i also wonder what this would look like with a different colored background?</td>', 'I like the pop art of Andy Warhol.this is a nice tribute to that.a small nit pick (does that phrase refer to head lice?) would be to remove the stickers from inside the shoes.there are only two and it didn''t detract from the score I gave you (7), but i just think it would make it look better overall.oh, i also wonder what this would look like with a different colored background?', '2006-01-30 21:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103695, 284028, 18219, '<td valign="top">ah, Man Ray, I haven''t thought about him in years.<br/>Nice reproduction.<br/>I like it.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'ah, Man Ray, I haven''t thought about him in years.Nice reproduction.I like it.Good luck.', '2006-01-30 21:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103696, 285211, 18219, '<td valign="top">very surreal and freaky!!!<br/>I like it a lot.<br/>I''m not sure how you achieved it, but I''m looking forward to finding out.</td>', 'very surreal and freaky!!!I like it a lot.I''m not sure how you achieved it, but I''m looking forward to finding out.', '2006-01-30 21:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103697, 285312, 18219, '<td valign="top">very nice colors.<br/>they almost clash too much, but I think they work.<br/>At least that is my opinion.<br/>good luck.</td>', 'very nice colors.they almost clash too much, but I think they work.At least that is my opinion.good luck.', '2006-01-30 21:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
