(2105453, 285747, 22046, '<td valign="top">Probably somebody already told you this... her name is Dorathea Lange. I like this but think that his bright zipper interfears with the mood.</td>', 'Probably somebody already told you this... her name is Dorathea Lange. I like this but think that his bright zipper interfears with the mood.', '2006-01-31 14:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105480, 284602, 12578, '<td valign="top">great lighting and mood but dont like the foot being cropped off, would be better to see the toes a little more and the three reflections you have on the models left leg look like scars which would be best brushed out with teh advanced editing allowed within the challenge. Good luck</td>', 'great lighting and mood but dont like the foot being cropped off, would be better to see the toes a little more and the three reflections you have on the models left leg look like scars which would be best brushed out with teh advanced editing allowed within the challenge. Good luck', '2006-01-31 14:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105486, 284690, 15810, '<td valign="top">I wonder what he would have made of today''s digital SLR''s and Photoshop. Nicely handled light and exposure, I think he would have approved.</td>', 'I wonder what he would have made of today''s digital SLR''s and Photoshop. Nicely handled light and exposure, I think he would have approved.', '2006-01-31 14:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105513, 285726, 15810, '<td valign="top">Yes it''s a man at work but I dont get the heavy industrial feel that I think I should, in fact I get a feeling of isolation and remoteness from this shot. Sorry just my initial opinion and I''m no expert on Lewis Hine''s full body of work.</td>', 'Yes it''s a man at work but I dont get the heavy industrial feel that I think I should, in fact I get a feeling of isolation and remoteness from this shot. Sorry just my initial opinion and I''m no expert on Lewis Hine''s full body of work.', '2006-01-31 14:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105522, 283627, 19708, '<td valign="top">Man oh man did you nail his style.<br/>This is a stunning example of his portraiture.</td>', 'Man oh man did you nail his style.This is a stunning example of his portraiture.', '2006-01-31 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105538, 285519, 15810, '<td valign="top">Love this shot with it''s elevated viewpoint. A nice modern tribute to Andre Kertesz.</td>', 'Love this shot with it''s elevated viewpoint. A nice modern tribute to Andre Kertesz.', '2006-01-31 15:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105550, 284447, 15810, '<td valign="top">Love this photographers work but I think you need a little more tonal range in your B&amp;W tribute to him.</td>', 'Love this photographers work but I think you need a little more tonal range in your B&W tribute to him.', '2006-01-31 15:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105566, 283986, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great sky shot but I think your focus is somewhere quite a bit nearer than the horizon.</td>', 'Great sky shot but I think your focus is somewhere quite a bit nearer than the horizon.', '2006-01-31 15:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105574, 285753, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, everthing fits here, lighting composition and mood. Super!</td>', 'Very good shot, everthing fits here, lighting composition and mood. Super!', '2006-01-31 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105580, 284159, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good good good!</td>', 'Good good good!', '2006-01-31 15:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105581, 285554, 15810, '<td valign="top">This is really really good, you have got the colouring and the slightly disturbing edge exactly right, this would look great as alrge installation. Well Done.</td>', 'This is really really good, you have got the colouring and the slightly disturbing edge exactly right, this would look great as alrge installation. Well Done.', '2006-01-31 15:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105591, 285575, 5728, '<td valign="top">Impressive!<br/> <br/>Update: This my top scorer for this challenge, but of course the DPC''ers will think otherwise :)</td>', 'Impressive! Update: This my top scorer for this challenge, but of course the DPC''ers will think otherwise :)', '2006-01-31 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105611, 285117, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is great, it has such a 20''s feel to it. I would have rated this as my top favourite had it been for the composition. The area on the otherside of the wall I would have completely subtracted from this image. I would have gone for a different angle and taken in only the wall on the left without what is on the otherside. It is still my second favourite for the challenge :)</td>', 'This is great, it has such a 20''s feel to it. I would have rated this as my top favourite had it been for the composition. The area on the otherside of the wall I would have completely subtracted from this image. I would have gone for a different angle and taken in only the wall on the left without what is on the otherside. It is still my second favourite for the challenge :)', '2006-01-31 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105637, 285338, 15810, '<td valign="top">I suppose the biggest questions is, why did you convert to B&amp;W since many (I know not all)of the TrekEarth shots and Many''s portraits are alive with colour?  The composition and model''s look are bang on but I think your B&amp;W would benefit from a boost in contrast too. Just MHO.</td>', 'I suppose the biggest questions is, why did you convert to B&W since many (I know not all)of the TrekEarth shots and Many''s portraits are alive with colour?  The composition and model''s look are bang on but I think your B&W would benefit from a boost in contrast too. Just MHO.', '2006-01-31 15:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105853, 284864, 15810, '<td valign="top">Thanks for providing the link, I enjoyed browsing the site. You have captured a similar feel although I would have been tempted to put a really interesting border on my submission like many of the more challenging shots on the site.</td>', 'Thanks for providing the link, I enjoyed browsing the site. You have captured a similar feel although I would have been tempted to put a really interesting border on my submission like many of the more challenging shots on the site.', '2006-01-31 16:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105865, 283617, 15810, '<td valign="top">Beautiful B&amp;W with all the textures I''d expect from this tribute. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful B&W with all the textures I''d expect from this tribute. Well done.', '2006-01-31 16:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105882, 285690, 15810, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to get that 1930''s hollywood look off perfectly. One of the best tributes so far. Love it. 10</td>', 'You''ve managed to get that 1930''s hollywood look off perfectly. One of the best tributes so far. Love it. 10', '2006-01-31 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105888, 284112, 40819, '<td valign="top">I like this but what I think would have made it perfect would be balanced lighting. Her mouth and cheeks are much brighter then the flowers and over power her eyes, which are lovely BTW. A great idea though.<br/> <br/>If you had used a soft box or even a white cardboard to defuse the flash or light you used I think that would have balenced the lihgt a little better.</td>', 'I like this but what I think would have made it perfect would be balanced lighting. Her mouth and cheeks are much brighter then the flowers and over power her eyes, which are lovely BTW. A great idea though. If you had used a soft box or even a white cardboard to defuse the flash or light you used I think that would have balenced the lihgt a little better.', '2006-01-31 16:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105890, 285196, 15810, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, love the minimal cleverness and the tones are just as good as jjbeguin. Love it. 10</td>', 'Stunning shot, love the minimal cleverness and the tones are just as good as jjbeguin. Love it. 10', '2006-01-31 16:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105927, 284661, 15810, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured an older style feeling here very well.</td>', 'You''ve captured an older style feeling here very well.', '2006-01-31 16:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105947, 283628, 15810, '<td valign="top">wow, you''ve made this look genuinely like an old Japanese albumen print.</td>', 'wow, you''ve made this look genuinely like an old Japanese albumen print.', '2006-01-31 16:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
