(2106535, 285640, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think you did great finding a pepper that was twisted and contorted like a human body.  Weston loved that.  I can''t decide about the background.  I think I''d like it better if it competed less overall.  Still a nice conversion to B&amp;W.</td>', 'I think you did great finding a pepper that was twisted and contorted like a human body.  Weston loved that.  I can''t decide about the background.  I think I''d like it better if it competed less overall.  Still a nice conversion to B&W.', '2006-01-31 19:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106557, 285656, 40718, '<td valign="top">captures his color shots well (even though there were fewer of those).  I think he really makes a point of having the phallic stigma show though...7</td>', 'captures his color shots well (even though there were fewer of those).  I think he really makes a point of having the phallic stigma show though...7', '2006-01-31 19:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106558, 285594, 14620, '<td valign="top">While the close up photo works, I think an important thing missing here are the super lit, very sharp over exaggerated eyes that come across in his portraits.  But I can see the inspiration.</td>', 'While the close up photo works, I think an important thing missing here are the super lit, very sharp over exaggerated eyes that come across in his portraits.  But I can see the inspiration.', '2006-01-31 19:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106599, 283710, 30214, '<td valign="top">the photo really demands sharp skies, imo</td>', 'the photo really demands sharp skies, imo', '2006-01-31 19:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106647, 285589, 42005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and texture. 10</td>', 'Wonderful color and texture. 10', '2006-01-31 19:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106658, 283475, 42005, '<td valign="top">Your photo is my favorite in this challenge.  I just like absollutely everything about it.  I hope<br/>you plan on selling prints. 10</td>', 'Your photo is my favorite in this challenge.  I just like absollutely everything about it.  I hopeyou plan on selling prints. 10', '2006-01-31 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106663, 283710, 48990, '<td valign="top">that is so cool</td>', 'that is so cool', '2006-01-31 19:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106753, 285117, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice period piece.</td>', 'Very nice period piece.', '2006-01-31 20:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106784, 283630, 46336, '<td valign="top">Cute kid. I feel the face is a little over-exposed (perhaps soften the flash), and the background is distracting (would have done well to move the duvet). <br/> <br/>Personally I think what Anne Geddes does to children is a form of child-crultey (especially when they get older), so thanks for at least not potting the kid like soem flower.</td>', 'Cute kid. I feel the face is a little over-exposed (perhaps soften the flash), and the background is distracting (would have done well to move the duvet).  Personally I think what Anne Geddes does to children is a form of child-crultey (especially when they get older), so thanks for at least not potting the kid like soem flower.', '2006-01-31 20:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106800, 285451, 46336, '<td valign="top">I thought he was a landscape artist. Oh well, I consider the shot on it''s own merits. The purple border is too distracting for the image. What is the image of, anyway?</td>', 'I thought he was a landscape artist. Oh well, I consider the shot on it''s own merits. The purple border is too distracting for the image. What is the image of, anyway?', '2006-01-31 20:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106811, 284540, 46336, '<td valign="top">Validated. That''s extreme use of photoshop. It''s hard for me to think of this as anything but digital art, but I''ll give it a shot. Nice and bold - it certianly catches the eye.</td>', 'Validated. That''s extreme use of photoshop. It''s hard for me to think of this as anything but digital art, but I''ll give it a shot. Nice and bold - it certianly catches the eye.', '2006-01-31 20:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106825, 285196, 34763, '<td valign="top">Simple and so maybe ''50''ish. The tones and lack of clutter,the reflection really pull the vision into the photo. Good work!</td>', 'Simple and so maybe ''50''ish. The tones and lack of clutter,the reflection really pull the vision into the photo. Good work!', '2006-01-31 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106917, 284688, 52108, '<td valign="top">Real great photography work ! Nice capture.</td>', 'Real great photography work ! Nice capture.', '2006-01-31 21:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
