(2108158, 285338, 14386, '<td valign="top">I am flattered.  I certainly am not in the league of those photographers thus, it was a surprise to see this here and finishing quite high.<br/> <br/>If it were me, I would certainly go for a clored version or if I do BW, I boost up the contrast.  But hey, this is beautiful and a chraming shot on its own.  Tribute or not, this is a great shot.<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'I am flattered.  I certainly am not in the league of those photographers thus, it was a surprise to see this here and finishing quite high. If it were me, I would certainly go for a clored version or if I do BW, I boost up the contrast.  But hey, this is beautiful and a chraming shot on its own.  Tribute or not, this is a great shot. Manny', '2006-02-01 01:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2108174, 285308, 46024, '<td valign="top">WOW this was a flop! I can''t believe how badly it did. I must be the most erratic contestant, 86% in my first challenge and 4% in my second.  Oh well, I''m still new.<br/> <br/>I liked the way Karl could take a person and capture them in the moment which is what I tried to do - the soft focus was my input - I felt it gave the sense of her being ghost-like and adding to the "creepy" mood of the image, obviously not a very popular choice.  I guess I never really did Karl much justice did I? (that was a rhetorical question so please don''t have a go at me)</td>', 'WOW this was a flop! I can''t believe how badly it did. I must be the most erratic contestant, 86% in my first challenge and 4% in my second.  Oh well, I''m still new. I liked the way Karl could take a person and capture them in the moment which is what I tried to do - the soft focus was my input - I felt it gave the sense of her being ghost-like and adding to the "creepy" mood of the image, obviously not a very popular choice.  I guess I never really did Karl much justice did I? (that was a rhetorical question so please don''t have a go at me)', '2006-02-01 01:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
