(2109584, 285747, 25655, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. <br/>I could write a lot about the frank and simple way Dorothea Lang displays her portraiture. I really love this photographer. <br/>You also display emotion in a very simple way. You don''t need much of a sorrounding elements to enhance anything you present.<br/>I am not sure about this edit, as it feels a bit too dark to me, and I don''t think it is needed. I think this man''s eyes say enough without the need to be in a dark area.<br/>But other then that I think this is a fine tribute to a great photogrpaher!</td>', 'This is a great shot. I could write a lot about the frank and simple way Dorothea Lang displays her portraiture. I really love this photographer. You also display emotion in a very simple way. You don''t need much of a sorrounding elements to enhance anything you present.I am not sure about this edit, as it feels a bit too dark to me, and I don''t think it is needed. I think this man''s eyes say enough without the need to be in a dark area.But other then that I think this is a fine tribute to a great photogrpaher!', '2006-02-01 09:15:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2109589, 285492, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 5 Dan - terrific job as usual.  Those eyes are amazing!</td>', 'Congrats on top 5 Dan - terrific job as usual.  Those eyes are amazing!', '2006-02-01 09:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2109594, 285718, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great job!  This one really stood out in the crowd - very unique and creative.  And I think you did Uelsmann proud.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-01 09:18:39.</i></td>', 'Great job!  This one really stood out in the crowd - very unique and creative.  And I think you did Uelsmann proud.', '2006-02-01 09:17:58.000000', '2006-02-01 09:18:39.000000', 0),
