(2111229, 283627, 1717, '<td valign="top">brilliant work, as always!  congrats on another ribbon! *hug*</td>', 'brilliant work, as always!  congrats on another ribbon! *hug*', '2006-02-01 15:52:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111324, 285492, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, great photo. :)</td>', 'Cool idea, great photo. :)', '2006-02-01 16:15:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111360, 285726, 3032, '<td valign="top">Another one of those b&amp;w images of yours that I felt had that little bit of extra. Yes it is soft, yes it has strange contrast, yes it is a bit noisy in the sky. But on the other hand, the whole of that yes yes yes in the previous sentence, it gives a special kind of ambiance and feel to it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Another one of those b&w images of yours that I felt had that little bit of extra. Yes it is soft, yes it has strange contrast, yes it is a bit noisy in the sky. But on the other hand, the whole of that yes yes yes in the previous sentence, it gives a special kind of ambiance and feel to it. ', '2006-02-01 16:26:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111395, 285602, 3032, '<td valign="top">Ben I don''t know why, but I just knew this was yours. It can''t be that I recognized Jodie''s face just from your portfolio image or is it somehow your own style? Perhaps you have shown some pics in the chat once. Doesn''t really matter.<br/> <br/>I am a bit surprised that it finished 111th, because I thought it was a very nice portrait. Everything is in kind of sweet soft tones and light but the eyes stand out so well with that hard blue.</td>', 'Ben I don''t know why, but I just knew this was yours. It can''t be that I recognized Jodie''s face just from your portfolio image or is it somehow your own style? Perhaps you have shown some pics in the chat once. Doesn''t really matter. I am a bit surprised that it finished 111th, because I thought it was a very nice portrait. Everything is in kind of sweet soft tones and light but the eyes stand out so well with that hard blue.', '2006-02-01 16:37:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111531, 285593, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think you captured the "3 secs of eternity" well, but there are technical issues with the picture that Doisneau may have been master enough to handle on the fly.  The composition is both good and bad.  The seat and passenger frame our subject nicely, but they also command a huge portion of the frame without adding anything.  The seat is blase and the guy with the jacket is more or less black.  Doisneau''s The Kiss also managed to transport us to a place where we wanted to be.  Look, love springs eternal on the streets of Paris. I want to be there.  I''m not quite sure we want to be reading the paper on a commute to that dead-end job. ;)</td>', 'I think you captured the "3 secs of eternity" well, but there are technical issues with the picture that Doisneau may have been master enough to handle on the fly.  The composition is both good and bad.  The seat and passenger frame our subject nicely, but they also command a huge portion of the frame without adding anything.  The seat is blase and the guy with the jacket is more or less black.  Doisneau''s The Kiss also managed to transport us to a place where we wanted to be.  Look, love springs eternal on the streets of Paris. I want to be there.  I''m not quite sure we want to be reading the paper on a commute to that dead-end job. ;)', '2006-02-01 17:19:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111651, 285312, 29658, '<td valign="top">Congrats Rikki, well done.</td>', 'Congrats Rikki, well done.', '2006-02-01 17:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111666, 283627, 40797, '<td valign="top">I thought that this was your work! Congraatulations!</td>', 'I thought that this was your work! Congraatulations!', '2006-02-01 18:02:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111698, 284969, 17134, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t give the model the room she deservers! The trees in de back are way to uninteresting to have so much space! Maybe a portrait (instead of landscape) would have been better?<br/> <br/>Great model btw.. i wonder if my colleagues would be interested in doing the same during my lunchbreak! ;)</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t give the model the room she deservers! The trees in de back are way to uninteresting to have so much space! Maybe a portrait (instead of landscape) would have been better? Great model btw.. i wonder if my colleagues would be interested in doing the same during my lunchbreak! ;)', '2006-02-01 18:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111737, 285338, 31889, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by librodo:</b></div><hr/><i>If it were me, I would certainly go for a clored version or if I do BW, I boost up the contrast.  But hey, this is beautiful and a chraming shot on its own.  Tribute or not, this is a great shot.<br/> <br/>Manny </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hah! How many people can say they got a comment from their chosen photographer :)<br/> <br/>Thanks Manny.  <br/> <br/>It''s funny that I had a color version and a higher contrast version to select from and ended up submitting this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-01 19:12:47.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by librodo:If it were me, I would certainly go for a clored version or if I do BW, I boost up the contrast.  But hey, this is beautiful and a chraming shot on its own.  Tribute or not, this is a great shot. Manny   Hah! How many people can say they got a comment from their chosen photographer :) Thanks Manny.   It''s funny that I had a color version and a higher contrast version to select from and ended up submitting this one.', '2006-02-01 18:27:31.000000', '2006-02-01 19:12:47.000000', 0),
(2111843, 285554, 35517, '<td valign="top">WOW WOW WOW...i simply love this one.. if i could give you my spot i would, this was so totally underrated.. awesome work mate...</td>', 'WOW WOW WOW...i simply love this one.. if i could give you my spot i would, this was so totally underrated.. awesome work mate...', '2006-02-01 18:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111933, 285519, 3087, '<td valign="top">This image stood out to me when I browsed the entries during voting but I didn''t have time to comment then and forgot to come back to it. What a delight to find it''s another one of yours... I''m becoming rather a fan! This really is one of my top 3 in this challenge, indeed one of my favourites for a while.</td>', 'This image stood out to me when I browsed the entries during voting but I didn''t have time to comment then and forgot to come back to it. What a delight to find it''s another one of yours... I''m becoming rather a fan! This really is one of my top 3 in this challenge, indeed one of my favourites for a while.', '2006-02-01 19:19:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2111955, 285602, 3087, '<td valign="top">She is indeed stunning and this truly is a great portrait... I''m glad you knocked the highlights on her skin down too - evens the tones out wonderfully. I think you should print this nice and big and frame it for your desk or wall. Surely she''s changed her mind about being unphotogenic now?</td>', 'She is indeed stunning and this truly is a great portrait... I''m glad you knocked the highlights on her skin down too - evens the tones out wonderfully. I think you should print this nice and big and frame it for your desk or wall. Surely she''s changed her mind about being unphotogenic now?', '2006-02-01 19:23:17.000000', NULL, 0),
