(2120837, 284690, 25355, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Of course, those objects wouldn''t have been so old to him (well, the book, at least, seeing he died in 1851). <br/>   I wonder what''s in your collection of Victorian photography. Do you have an on-line galery of your collection?</td>', 'Simple but effective. Of course, those objects wouldn''t have been so old to him (well, the book, at least, seeing he died in 1851).    I wonder what''s in your collection of Victorian photography. Do you have an on-line galery of your collection?', '2006-02-04 06:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
