(2123020, 285562, 34217, '<td valign="top">This is very cute, but it looks like you retouched the babies face.  Babies usually have perfect skin and should not need to be retouched.  I would have liked to see the original.  If it has not been retouched then I wish I had skin like your baby.  I photograph children and babies for a living and I think you did an excellent job with your framing and the facial expression.</td>', 'This is very cute, but it looks like you retouched the babies face.  Babies usually have perfect skin and should not need to be retouched.  I would have liked to see the original.  If it has not been retouched then I wish I had skin like your baby.  I photograph children and babies for a living and I think you did an excellent job with your framing and the facial expression.', '2006-02-05 00:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
