(2200243, 284224, 54457, '<td valign="top">Glad to see Johnson insired someone else :)<br/>Interesting how it has influenced you, and I noted the main subject of the image is a person, of which there are very few within his own work.<br/>For me, his abilities lie more so in the way he presents an unbiased view of a subject with sensitive and unprobing observation. He also uses a lot of diagonals when concerning the man made world. Gone off on a bit of a tangent there! I can see where you were coming from, the over exposed BG is not enough to wipe it out however and so there remains little details that distract from the subject.<br/></td>', 'Glad to see Johnson insired someone else :)Interesting how it has influenced you, and I noted the main subject of the image is a person, of which there are very few within his own work.For me, his abilities lie more so in the way he presents an unbiased view of a subject with sensitive and unprobing observation. He also uses a lot of diagonals when concerning the man made world. Gone off on a bit of a tangent there! I can see where you were coming from, the over exposed BG is not enough to wipe it out however and so there remains little details that distract from the subject.', '2006-03-04 16:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
